(5425408, 780535, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting because I''m in the challenge with you, but if I wasn''t, this would have received a high mark from me. The transition from warm to cool colors is excellent, and the way the points thrust into focus and fade off into nothingness is great.</td>', 'I''m not voting because I''m in the challenge with you, but if I wasn''t, this would have received a high mark from me. The transition from warm to cool colors is excellent, and the way the points thrust into focus and fade off into nothingness is great.', '2009-04-08 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
