(5425463, 780409, 80167, '<td valign="top">While I think that this is a great shot, I don''t think it meets the challenge all that well. Yes, there''s some texture in the birds'' wings, but it''s rather subtle and not a focal point of the image.</td>', 'While I think that this is a great shot, I don''t think it meets the challenge all that well. Yes, there''s some texture in the birds'' wings, but it''s rather subtle and not a focal point of the image.', '2009-04-08 01:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425471, 778949, 80167, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love it. The white background works very well and the unattractive branches offset the pretty flower very well. The green halo around the branches is a little frustrating, but that''s minor. 8</td>', 'Beautiful! I love it. The white background works very well and the unattractive branches offset the pretty flower very well. The green halo around the branches is a little frustrating, but that''s minor. 8', '2009-04-08 02:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
