(5425479, 780016, 80167, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it if this entire shot were in focus... or, if there was a more defined focal point. One or the other.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it if this entire shot were in focus... or, if there was a more defined focal point. One or the other.', '2009-04-08 02:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
