(5425496, 780479, 80167, '<td valign="top">My eye is having trouble finding the focal point. None of the pods themselves are entirely in focus which is what I find that I want to stare at - which makes this frustrating. Good concept, though!</td>', 'My eye is having trouble finding the focal point. None of the pods themselves are entirely in focus which is what I find that I want to stare at - which makes this frustrating. Good concept, though!', '2009-04-08 02:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
