(5425511, 779989, 80167, '<td valign="top">At this distance I would have liked to see everything in focus. Now, I find myself hunting for the focal point to rest my eyes. Good idea, though!</td>', 'At this distance I would have liked to see everything in focus. Now, I find myself hunting for the focal point to rest my eyes. Good idea, though!', '2009-04-08 02:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
