(5427115, 779339, 63499, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and example of texture. I think the texture would stand out better if the lighting had a little more dimension to it and if the image was a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice colors and example of texture. I think the texture would stand out better if the lighting had a little more dimension to it and if the image was a little sharper.', '2009-04-08 14:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
