(5427117, 779622, 63499, '<td valign="top">I agree the buckets are very textured looking and the wood fencing adds even more texture. The lighting looks a flat and the dark shadows are a little distracting. Maybe a bit more contrast? And I wonder if cropping it different would be better - crop it just below the shelf to get rid of the dark shadows and then include more of the fence above.</td>', 'I agree the buckets are very textured looking and the wood fencing adds even more texture. The lighting looks a flat and the dark shadows are a little distracting. Maybe a bit more contrast? And I wonder if cropping it different would be better - crop it just below the shelf to get rid of the dark shadows and then include more of the fence above.', '2009-04-08 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427118, 779954, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, textures and lines of this. I wish it was a little sharper though.</td>', 'I like the colors, textures and lines of this. I wish it was a little sharper though.', '2009-04-08 14:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427121, 780411, 63499, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh here. The over exposure is causing you to lose depth, detail and texture in the stone. I think with the right lighting, or exposure, this could be a great way to show texture.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh here. The over exposure is causing you to lose depth, detail and texture in the stone. I think with the right lighting, or exposure, this could be a great way to show texture.', '2009-04-08 15:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427126, 778977, 63499, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great way to show texture! The lighting, however, is very distracting - it''s too much in some areas and not enough in others.</td>', 'I think this is a great way to show texture! The lighting, however, is very distracting - it''s too much in some areas and not enough in others.', '2009-04-08 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427134, 780387, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like this. It shows texture well, has great lighting and the little bit of blue adds just the right amount of color to this.</td>', 'I like this. It shows texture well, has great lighting and the little bit of blue adds just the right amount of color to this.', '2009-04-08 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427137, 780462, 63499, '<td valign="top">So many textures here - from the smooth columns to the rough stone to the detail work along the windows and trim to the calm sky. The angle is interesting too. I only wish that you had either included more of the large window on the bottom or none of it. 9.</td>', 'So many textures here - from the smooth columns to the rough stone to the detail work along the windows and trim to the calm sky. The angle is interesting too. I only wish that you had either included more of the large window on the bottom or none of it. 9.', '2009-04-08 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427138, 780531, 63499, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, DOF and color. I also like that you have a range of textures with this photo.</td>', 'Nice lighting, DOF and color. I also like that you have a range of textures with this photo.', '2009-04-08 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427139, 779478, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in textures between the fur and the nose. The narrow DOF really accentuates the differences between the short, stubby feeling of the nose fur and the soft, longer fur on the rest of the face.</td>', 'I like the contrast in textures between the fur and the nose. The narrow DOF really accentuates the differences between the short, stubby feeling of the nose fur and the soft, longer fur on the rest of the face.', '2009-04-08 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427140, 780338, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of color - it really adds to the contrast between the two textures.</td>', 'I like the depth of color - it really adds to the contrast between the two textures.', '2009-04-08 15:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427141, 780492, 63499, '<td valign="top">Great lighting - it really shows the differences in textures between the two leaves. I also light the little splash of color that the red leaf adds.</td>', 'Great lighting - it really shows the differences in textures between the two leaves. I also light the little splash of color that the red leaf adds.', '2009-04-08 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427143, 779337, 63499, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice sharp photo and a great way to show texture.</td>', 'Good lighting, nice sharp photo and a great way to show texture.', '2009-04-08 15:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427158, 780350, 63499, '<td valign="top">I really like the looks of this. When I scrolled down to see the title and vote, I was surprised to see someone standing in the photo (I thought it was a macro of something). While the person gives the perspective of how big this really is, I like it better with out him in it.</td>', 'I really like the looks of this. When I scrolled down to see the title and vote, I was surprised to see someone standing in the photo (I thought it was a macro of something). While the person gives the perspective of how big this really is, I like it better with out him in it.', '2009-04-08 15:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427181, 779919, 103564, '<td valign="top">I love all the colors and they way the shades bring out the texture in them, great job</td>', 'I love all the colors and they way the shades bring out the texture in them, great job', '2009-04-08 15:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427183, 780218, 103564, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the clovers and I love the tones thast are used to bring out the texture and different shades</td>', 'Nice use of the clovers and I love the tones thast are used to bring out the texture and different shades', '2009-04-08 16:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427194, 780541, 92285, '<td valign="top">nice color and texture</td>', 'nice color and texture', '2009-04-08 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427195, 780213, 92285, '<td valign="top">Ok but would have liked to see the other side for more texture and color</td>', 'Ok but would have liked to see the other side for more texture and color', '2009-04-08 16:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427198, 780348, 92285, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2009-04-08 16:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427200, 780303, 92285, '<td valign="top">nice array of textures</td>', 'nice array of textures', '2009-04-08 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5427203, 780211, 25522, '<td valign="top">I love this image.  I can feel the rough texture of the skin and the smooth slippery fruit inside.  Excellent presentation for texture.</td>', 'I love this image.  I can feel the rough texture of the skin and the smooth slippery fruit inside.  Excellent presentation for texture.', '2009-04-08 16:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427210, 780485, 92285, '<td valign="top">too blurred</td>', 'too blurred', '2009-04-08 16:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427219, 780536, 92285, '<td valign="top">Texture, power of color and beauty all in one!!</td>', 'Texture, power of color and beauty all in one!!', '2009-04-08 16:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427224, 779285, 92285, '<td valign="top">crisp, wet and sharp texture.</td>', 'crisp, wet and sharp texture.', '2009-04-08 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427241, 780457, 92285, '<td valign="top">I think if the flowers would have been more in focus it would have made for a more interesting shot</td>', 'I think if the flowers would have been more in focus it would have made for a more interesting shot', '2009-04-08 16:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427323, 780345, 105742, '<td valign="top">Great picture</td>', 'Great picture', '2009-04-08 17:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427326, 780282, 61961, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a bit odd to me, not just lacking clarity but almost pixelated.  It may be you need experience in resizing photos for the web.</td>', 'This photo seems a bit odd to me, not just lacking clarity but almost pixelated.  It may be you need experience in resizing photos for the web.', '2009-04-08 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427465, 779116, 105399, '<td valign="top">It is a little to dark. Sorry.</td>', 'It is a little to dark. Sorry.', '2009-04-08 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427466, 780030, 105399, '<td valign="top">To dark, sorry.</td>', 'To dark, sorry.', '2009-04-08 19:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427470, 779477, 105399, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2009-04-08 19:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427473, 779793, 105399, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark</td>', 'Kind of dark', '2009-04-08 19:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427477, 780279, 105399, '<td valign="top">Too dark, sorry</td>', 'Too dark, sorry', '2009-04-08 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427485, 779365, 105399, '<td valign="top">Sorry, it''s kind of dark.</td>', 'Sorry, it''s kind of dark.', '2009-04-08 19:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427489, 780358, 105399, '<td valign="top">Kind of dark, it makes it harder to see the spider.</td>', 'Kind of dark, it makes it harder to see the spider.', '2009-04-08 19:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427501, 780223, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply eye watering visual effect. It''s very hard to concentrate on one particular aspect of the image without being forced to look away at another - very effective and interesting. One can create a very interesting visual by adjusting seating position and moving in and out from the monitor. For just simple visual impact and inventiveness, this is a good start - a top contender for a ribbon.</td>', 'Simply eye watering visual effect. It''s very hard to concentrate on one particular aspect of the image without being forced to look away at another - very effective and interesting. One can create a very interesting visual by adjusting seating position and moving in and out from the monitor. For just simple visual impact and inventiveness, this is a good start - a top contender for a ribbon.', '2009-04-08 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427507, 780532, 101256, '<td valign="top">The true measure of elegance is simple and refined - this image meets that criteria with an inventive use of color, shape and texture. The excellant DOF just flows with the overall concept of smooth. The only flaw is the white bloom while not overdone by any means, doesn''t assist the image which is an unfortunate by product of the lighting. The little reflections towards the top of the stone are also just a touch annoying. Overall a good solid effort and worthy of consideration as a top ten image.</td>', 'The true measure of elegance is simple and refined - this image meets that criteria with an inventive use of color, shape and texture. The excellant DOF just flows with the overall concept of smooth. The only flaw is the white bloom while not overdone by any means, doesn''t assist the image which is an unfortunate by product of the lighting. The little reflections towards the top of the stone are also just a touch annoying. Overall a good solid effort and worthy of consideration as a top ten image.', '2009-04-08 19:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427510, 779888, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another example of how simple shapes and curves can evoke positive imagery. The subtle greens are well controlled which is difficult in any setting. Plenty of soft even lighting which only enhances the overall impact. There aren''t any minor flaws. A ribbon contender for sure.</td>', 'Another example of how simple shapes and curves can evoke positive imagery. The subtle greens are well controlled which is difficult in any setting. Plenty of soft even lighting which only enhances the overall impact. There aren''t any minor flaws. A ribbon contender for sure.', '2009-04-08 19:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427516, 780165, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very subtle lighting from the side creates a very antique looking grain effect - this works very well as the creases on the bindings show years of use. The viewer can extract the canvas book bindings without much effort imparting a sense of time and space.  A excellant effort.</td>', 'Very subtle lighting from the side creates a very antique looking grain effect - this works very well as the creases on the bindings show years of use. The viewer can extract the canvas book bindings without much effort imparting a sense of time and space.  A excellant effort.', '2009-04-08 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427520, 779644, 101256, '<td valign="top">Subtle tonal imagery of old cracking paint covering figured wood - a great composition. The only minor issue is the lack of tone control and the image might have had more impact with a minor crop of 25% off the bottom to concentrate on the more interesting figured aspects of the door knob and immediate area.  A good solid image evoking texture.</td>', 'Subtle tonal imagery of old cracking paint covering figured wood - a great composition. The only minor issue is the lack of tone control and the image might have had more impact with a minor crop of 25% off the bottom to concentrate on the more interesting figured aspects of the door knob and immediate area.  A good solid image evoking texture.', '2009-04-08 19:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427521, 779984, 38162, '<td valign="top">depth of field issue with this one - great concept though</td>', 'depth of field issue with this one - great concept though', '2009-04-08 19:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427524, 779375, 38162, '<td valign="top">windy title hurts this one</td>', 'windy title hurts this one', '2009-04-08 19:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427527, 778833, 38162, '<td valign="top">welcome to the graveyard of abstracts!  I love it.  8.5</td>', 'welcome to the graveyard of abstracts!  I love it.  8.5', '2009-04-08 19:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427528, 779992, 101256, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the image appears to be slightly softer in focus which doesn''t help impart a sense of "texture". It might have been better to concentrate on one animal and attempt to get as much detail out of the dirty wool as possible in particular along the neck line.  A good concept however just lacking in execution.</td>', 'Unfortunately the image appears to be slightly softer in focus which doesn''t help impart a sense of "texture". It might have been better to concentrate on one animal and attempt to get as much detail out of the dirty wool as possible in particular along the neck line.  A good concept however just lacking in execution.', '2009-04-08 19:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427529, 779988, 38162, '<td valign="top">welcome to the graveyard of abstracts.  this is super!  8.</td>', 'welcome to the graveyard of abstracts.  this is super!  8.', '2009-04-08 19:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427530, 779984, 99063, '<td valign="top">cool -- definitely like the idea.  Only two things I''d suggest: 1) something black or white, maybe, on the cork-board?, and 2) lighting is a bit flat (I know that''s not a suggestion, but I know basically squat on how to improve upon lighting situations, so I''d be talking out my butt if I actually did suggest anything on this point).  ;)</td>', 'cool -- definitely like the idea.  Only two things I''d suggest: 1) something black or white, maybe, on the cork-board?, and 2) lighting is a bit flat (I know that''s not a suggestion, but I know basically squat on how to improve upon lighting situations, so I''d be talking out my butt if I actually did suggest anything on this point).  ;)', '2009-04-08 19:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427533, 779932, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good abstract containg various elements of texture and color. The odd lighting helps the image, but would have been more effective if the darker circle surrounding the central area had been carried through to the bottom of the image. An appearance of a sharp image with soft focus which is interesting. A good solid effort at examining texture and color.</td>', 'A good abstract containg various elements of texture and color. The odd lighting helps the image, but would have been more effective if the darker circle surrounding the central area had been carried through to the bottom of the image. An appearance of a sharp image with soft focus which is interesting. A good solid effort at examining texture and color.', '2009-04-08 19:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427536, 779356, 101256, '<td valign="top">Two ways of looking at this - in both cases it''s a excellant image. If it didn''t have the DOF fade, it might have had more impact visually, but as it stands the foreground details are sharp and crisp wtih interesting shapes and colors blending into a sort of phantasia of pleasing contours. A contender for a top ten score if not higher.</td>', 'Two ways of looking at this - in both cases it''s a excellant image. If it didn''t have the DOF fade, it might have had more impact visually, but as it stands the foreground details are sharp and crisp wtih interesting shapes and colors blending into a sort of phantasia of pleasing contours. A contender for a top ten score if not higher.', '2009-04-08 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427542, 779952, 101256, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, crisp and very detailing until the eye where is loses detail due to lighting issues. The grain effect is well controlled and enhances the image positively. While there is a lot of detail, it doesn''t quite evoke the texture concept as well as it might - as an fauna image, it''s excellant.</td>', 'Dramatic, crisp and very detailing until the eye where is loses detail due to lighting issues. The grain effect is well controlled and enhances the image positively. While there is a lot of detail, it doesn''t quite evoke the texture concept as well as it might - as an fauna image, it''s excellant.', '2009-04-08 19:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427547, 780183, 101256, '<td valign="top">Elegant in it''s simplicity with an abstract minimalist appeal. The whites are well controlled against the beige background and the offset window placement showing no detail except for the frame is inspired. An excellant effort and worth of ribbon contention.</td>', 'Elegant in it''s simplicity with an abstract minimalist appeal. The whites are well controlled against the beige background and the offset window placement showing no detail except for the frame is inspired. An excellant effort and worth of ribbon contention.', '2009-04-08 19:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427551, 780333, 101256, '<td valign="top">Only the lower 25% could be considerd "texture" in a strict interpretation as the DOF is slightly overdone. A slightly taller angle would have given better control of DOF imparting a better sense of detail fulfilling the theme of the challenge. Having said that, the overall color tone control is excellant with subtle shade differences that are very hard to pull off with success and the author has done well in this area. A good effort.</td>', 'Only the lower 25% could be considerd "texture" in a strict interpretation as the DOF is slightly overdone. A slightly taller angle would have given better control of DOF imparting a better sense of detail fulfilling the theme of the challenge. Having said that, the overall color tone control is excellant with subtle shade differences that are very hard to pull off with success and the author has done well in this area. A good effort.', '2009-04-08 19:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427562, 779931, 38162, '<td valign="top">border does not add a thing.  love the concept. 7</td>', 'border does not add a thing.  love the concept. 7', '2009-04-08 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427567, 780136, 103032, '<td valign="top">Blurry</td>', 'Blurry', '2009-04-08 19:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427568, 778966, 38162, '<td valign="top">bold attempt here.  great angle.  white balance really hurts this - one click in Bridge and its white.</td>', 'bold attempt here.  great angle.  white balance really hurts this - one click in Bridge and its white.', '2009-04-08 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427571, 780295, 38162, '<td valign="top">welcome to the graveyard of abstracts here.  I love it. 8.  imo, border does nothing for it.</td>', 'welcome to the graveyard of abstracts here.  I love it. 8.  imo, border does nothing for it.', '2009-04-08 20:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427572, 779528, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think additional lighting on the hands would have help high light the texture of the hands.</td>', 'I think additional lighting on the hands would have help high light the texture of the hands.', '2009-04-08 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427573, 779570, 103032, '<td valign="top"><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-04 00:09:33.</i></td>', '', '2009-04-08 20:02:39.000000', '2010-04-04 01:09:33.000000', 1),
(5427574, 779993, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, you can really see the various textures on the bird.</td>', 'Nice, you can really see the various textures on the bird.', '2009-04-08 20:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427576, 780112, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... Nice color, depth of focus and lighting - the three of them combined make the texture stand out.</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Nice color, depth of focus and lighting - the three of them combined make the texture stand out.', '2009-04-08 20:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427579, 779683, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice close up</td>', 'Nice close up', '2009-04-08 20:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427582, 779178, 103032, '<td valign="top">Texture of the adult is nicely captured.  Hard to see the baby''s texture...</td>', 'Texture of the adult is nicely captured.  Hard to see the baby''s texture...', '2009-04-08 20:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427583, 778834, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.</td>', 'Nice close up.', '2009-04-08 20:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427589, 780347, 103032, '<td valign="top">Need deeper/higher/more DOF, to get a feel for the texture of the iron and wood. IMO</td>', 'Need deeper/higher/more DOF, to get a feel for the texture of the iron and wood. IMO', '2009-04-08 20:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427594, 779392, 103032, '<td valign="top">Its in the shadows.  Would have worked better with some fill light.  IMO</td>', 'Its in the shadows.  Would have worked better with some fill light.  IMO', '2009-04-08 20:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427595, 779467, 101256, '<td valign="top">A refreshing look at texture in a very abstract way. Simple, yet complex at the same time. Interesting DOF control - very effective.</td>', 'A refreshing look at texture in a very abstract way. Simple, yet complex at the same time. Interesting DOF control - very effective.', '2009-04-08 20:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427597, 780483, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, I feel that</td>', 'Nice, I feel that', '2009-04-08 20:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427600, 779314, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little better control of the DOF would have made this a ribbon contender.  The excellant flow of the curved and figured wood is lost much too quickly to be effective. A great concept lacking in execution.</td>', 'A little better control of the DOF would have made this a ribbon contender.  The excellant flow of the curved and figured wood is lost much too quickly to be effective. A great concept lacking in execution.', '2009-04-08 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427601, 780213, 103032, '<td valign="top">Kinda soft.  For a texture shot, I would have liked a sharper image to see the patterns/intricacies of the feathers.  For me anyways...</td>', 'Kinda soft.  For a texture shot, I would have liked a sharper image to see the patterns/intricacies of the feathers.  For me anyways...', '2009-04-08 20:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427604, 780531, 57447, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge perfectly, nice shot.</td>', 'Fits challenge perfectly, nice shot.', '2009-04-08 20:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427606, 780065, 57447, '<td valign="top">Condensation..nice shot.</td>', 'Condensation..nice shot.', '2009-04-08 20:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427609, 780350, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect if only the hiker were absent from the scene. The hiker adds nothing to the soft glow of the image and draws the eye away from the gentle curves with their subtle shades of color. Very unfortunate.</td>', 'This would have been perfect if only the hiker were absent from the scene. The hiker adds nothing to the soft glow of the image and draws the eye away from the gentle curves with their subtle shades of color. Very unfortunate.', '2009-04-08 20:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427610, 780277, 57447, '<td valign="top">Good use of materials &amp; color.</td>', 'Good use of materials & color.', '2009-04-08 20:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427612, 780080, 103032, '<td valign="top">I prefer more DOF on texture shots.  The center and bottom is nicely focused but it get soft away from center.  Its just my preference though...</td>', 'I prefer more DOF on texture shots.  The center and bottom is nicely focused but it get soft away from center.  Its just my preference though...', '2009-04-08 20:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427613, 780346, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but wish there was more color.</td>', 'I like the composition but wish there was more color.', '2009-04-08 20:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427614, 779931, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific concept and nicely executed. The numerous shades of red blending to yellow give this a pleasant feeling. The detail of the charcoaled wood is pleasing, but not detailed enough to overpower the overall impression of heat and warmth. As a texture image, it works, but under whelming in detail. A good effort though worthy of a good score.</td>', 'A terrific concept and nicely executed. The numerous shades of red blending to yellow give this a pleasant feeling. The detail of the charcoaled wood is pleasing, but not detailed enough to overpower the overall impression of heat and warmth. As a texture image, it works, but under whelming in detail. A good effort though worthy of a good score.', '2009-04-08 20:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427616, 780391, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, just the way I like it.  The image that is...   Nice image.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, just the way I like it.  The image that is...   Nice image.', '2009-04-08 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427618, 780511, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and complex it can be quote beautiful and very scary at the same time. Excellant tonal control evoking many emotions and all are based on the texture surrounding the ethereal face. Well done and a worthy contender for a ribbon in this challenge.</td>', 'Simple and complex it can be quote beautiful and very scary at the same time. Excellant tonal control evoking many emotions and all are based on the texture surrounding the ethereal face. Well done and a worthy contender for a ribbon in this challenge.', '2009-04-08 20:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427619, 779999, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great idea, like the half face view and color of mask.</td>', 'Great idea, like the half face view and color of mask.', '2009-04-08 20:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427621, 780192, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment... I like the idea of using an orange peel to show texture. Nice lighting and focus, I just wish the dimples on the peel were a little deeper to show the texture better. 7.</td>', 'Coming back to comment... I like the idea of using an orange peel to show texture. Nice lighting and focus, I just wish the dimples on the peel were a little deeper to show the texture better. 7.', '2009-04-08 20:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427622, 779365, 103032, '<td valign="top"><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-04 00:11:30.</i></td>', '', '2009-04-08 20:23:57.000000', '2010-04-04 01:11:30.000000', 1),
(5427625, 780520, 57447, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Very creative shot for this challenge.', '2009-04-08 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427629, 779356, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like how the lighting, focus and colors help show the different textures on this. I''m not sure I''m crazy about the crop though. 7.</td>', 'I like how the lighting, focus and colors help show the different textures on this. I''m not sure I''m crazy about the crop though. 7.', '2009-04-08 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427631, 780517, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very clever use of reflection - imaginative and effective. The blending of curves and internal detail give an impression of texture in a unique way. The slight offset work well, but it''s cut off too soon on the right and bottom interrupting the flow of the curves. Not a major flaw, but it is distracting and negatively impacts the image''s flow. A solid effort and worthy of placement in the top fifteen.</td>', 'A very clever use of reflection - imaginative and effective. The blending of curves and internal detail give an impression of texture in a unique way. The slight offset work well, but it''s cut off too soon on the right and bottom interrupting the flow of the curves. Not a major flaw, but it is distracting and negatively impacts the image''s flow. A solid effort and worthy of placement in the top fifteen.', '2009-04-08 20:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427636, 780449, 98339, '<td valign="top">is this a damask pattern?  can''t really tell from the shot...sorry</td>', 'is this a damask pattern?  can''t really tell from the shot...sorry', '2009-04-08 20:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427638, 779466, 63499, '<td valign="top">Unique way of showing off texture! Am I correct in assuming that it''s all a reflection? Or does that building really have that many different textures on it? I like it.</td>', 'Unique way of showing off texture! Am I correct in assuming that it''s all a reflection? Or does that building really have that many different textures on it? I like it.', '2009-04-08 20:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427642, 780402, 103032, '<td valign="top"><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-04 00:10:25.</i></td>', '', '2009-04-08 20:30:41.000000', '2010-04-04 01:10:25.000000', 1),
(5427643, 779650, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have to many things competing for my attention...I''m not sure what I should be looking at...sorry</td>', 'you have to many things competing for my attention...I''m not sure what I should be looking at...sorry', '2009-04-08 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427646, 780533, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot, nice focus.</td>', 'Nice Shot, nice focus.', '2009-04-08 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427652, 779456, 103032, '<td valign="top">Kind of soft.  My preference is for a sharper image to high light the texture of the subject.  But thats just me...</td>', 'Kind of soft.  My preference is for a sharper image to high light the texture of the subject.  But thats just me...', '2009-04-08 20:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427656, 780091, 103032, '<td valign="top">Oooh what is it?  Sea barnacle thingys...  Nice texture shot.</td>', 'Oooh what is it?  Sea barnacle thingys...  Nice texture shot.', '2009-04-08 20:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427660, 780313, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent is plain and interesting, but fails just short of being an effective way of envoking texture. A tighter shot sans the branch would have helped convey the sense of dimension that a texture shot should have. As a fauna image, it''s excellant even with the branch in the way.</td>', 'The author''s intent is plain and interesting, but fails just short of being an effective way of envoking texture. A tighter shot sans the branch would have helped convey the sense of dimension that a texture shot should have. As a fauna image, it''s excellant even with the branch in the way.', '2009-04-08 20:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427661, 780471, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice tight close up.  Must be an Aussie shot, they have all the cool reptiles...</td>', 'Nice tight close up.  Must be an Aussie shot, they have all the cool reptiles...', '2009-04-08 20:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427665, 780501, 103032, '<td valign="top">You can see all kinds of textures here. 9</td>', 'You can see all kinds of textures here. 9', '2009-04-08 20:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427666, 779373, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s very hard to explain how unique this image - how much impact a simple weathered hand can have against the inspired background. A couple of minor flaws in a technical sense, but from an emotional standpoint, this is incredible in it''s impact on the viewer. An outstanding image evoking texture and humanity. Well done.</td>', 'It''s very hard to explain how unique this image - how much impact a simple weathered hand can have against the inspired background. A couple of minor flaws in a technical sense, but from an emotional standpoint, this is incredible in it''s impact on the viewer. An outstanding image evoking texture and humanity. Well done.', '2009-04-08 20:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427672, 779084, 101256, '<td valign="top">One of the better moon shots with excellant detail. As a challenge subject it works on a couple of levels, but falls just sort of having the sort of interest needed to be a really good contender for high placement.</td>', 'One of the better moon shots with excellant detail. As a challenge subject it works on a couple of levels, but falls just sort of having the sort of interest needed to be a really good contender for high placement.', '2009-04-08 20:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427673, 779128, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Nice detail.</td>', 'Nice image.  Nice detail.', '2009-04-08 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427680, 780224, 103032, '<td valign="top">Yet the focus is so sharp.  I like the sharp focus to be able to see the fur so well.</td>', 'Yet the focus is so sharp.  I like the sharp focus to be able to see the fur so well.', '2009-04-08 20:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427681, 780523, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing - a clever and unigue image. The major light bloom at the top of the eye has a significant impact on the image and not in a positive way - it would have had much more impact if the texture effect of the cornea had followed through to the top. As it is, it works well though and should be a top contender.</td>', 'Very intriguing - a clever and unigue image. The major light bloom at the top of the eye has a significant impact on the image and not in a positive way - it would have had much more impact if the texture effect of the cornea had followed through to the top. As it is, it works well though and should be a top contender.', '2009-04-08 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427682, 780481, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like it, but a tighter composition might even have been better.</td>', 'I like it, but a tighter composition might even have been better.', '2009-04-08 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427683, 780502, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant and richly detailed, this is a perfect capture.  The soft subtle colors are perfectly controled and an obvious effort to keep an even texture throughout the image is evident. An excellant effort - well done.</td>', 'Simple, elegant and richly detailed, this is a perfect capture.  The soft subtle colors are perfectly controled and an obvious effort to keep an even texture throughout the image is evident. An excellant effort - well done.', '2009-04-08 20:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427684, 780513, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, so this is a G-spot.....  Hmm.   Seriously though, what is it... a sea animal? a pet toy?</td>', 'Nice, so this is a G-spot.....  Hmm.   Seriously though, what is it... a sea animal? a pet toy?', '2009-04-08 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427693, 780511, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, kind of a creepy mummy... Algae?  Nice texture shot.</td>', 'Wow, kind of a creepy mummy... Algae?  Nice texture shot.', '2009-04-08 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427698, 780422, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  A little dark though.  Nice textures of the fungus.</td>', 'Nice composition.  A little dark though.  Nice textures of the fungus.', '2009-04-08 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427700, 780166, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic tone and lighting which work well, but the subject could have been lightened just a little to bring out the subtle curves and texture. The background is complimentary to the subject which makes it even more important to bring out some of the detail.  A good abstract concept just a little light on the execution.</td>', 'Very dramatic tone and lighting which work well, but the subject could have been lightened just a little to bring out the subtle curves and texture. The background is complimentary to the subject which makes it even more important to bring out some of the detail.  A good abstract concept just a little light on the execution.', '2009-04-08 20:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427701, 780516, 103032, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking you inverted the pic.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'I''m thinking you inverted the pic.  Interesting shot.', '2009-04-08 20:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427704, 779459, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF control, good detail in the petals and an effective presentation overall.  Falls just short of demonstrating the texture of the flowers, but the grainy texture and subtle lighting of the background make up for that. Nice concept and execution of an idea.</td>', 'Perfect DOF control, good detail in the petals and an effective presentation overall.  Falls just short of demonstrating the texture of the flowers, but the grainy texture and subtle lighting of the background make up for that. Nice concept and execution of an idea.', '2009-04-08 20:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427705, 780350, 95672, '<td valign="top">i love the texture in this photo i just wish the person at the bottom of the shot was not there i think it takes away from the texture as a whole</td>', 'i love the texture in this photo i just wish the person at the bottom of the shot was not there i think it takes away from the texture as a whole', '2009-04-08 21:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427706, 780548, 101256, '<td valign="top">Green is the hardest digital color to control. With excellant tone control and beautiful detail, this should be a top contender for a ribbon. Little minor technical flaws do not detract from the image''s overall impact and the impression of texture.  Well done.</td>', 'Green is the hardest digital color to control. With excellant tone control and beautiful detail, this should be a top contender for a ribbon. Little minor technical flaws do not detract from the image''s overall impact and the impression of texture.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 21:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427708, 780303, 98339, '<td valign="top">you could take out the top half of the photo and still have a better focus...my attention is all over the board, kind of wondering what I should be looking at as the "feature"</td>', 'you could take out the top half of the photo and still have a better focus...my attention is all over the board, kind of wondering what I should be looking at as the "feature"', '2009-04-08 21:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
