(5427735, 780316, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful impressionist image in which the soft focus effect and subtle tones work well with the detailed flower.  The orange does well with the lighter background and is very effective. Over all a great contribution.</td>', 'A beautiful impressionist image in which the soft focus effect and subtle tones work well with the detailed flower.  The orange does well with the lighter background and is very effective. Over all a great contribution.', '2009-04-08 21:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
