(5427767, 780482, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very abstract in concept and execution, but a little too busy to be truly effective. The amount of detail overwhelms the visual senses creating a discomforting visual. In a larger format or with a little longer focal length this would have worked much better as the details would have blended more creating a more favorable impression.</td>', 'Very abstract in concept and execution, but a little too busy to be truly effective. The amount of detail overwhelms the visual senses creating a discomforting visual. In a larger format or with a little longer focal length this would have worked much better as the details would have blended more creating a more favorable impression.', '2009-04-08 21:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
