(5428027, 780004, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good concept, but the image is too softly focused to be truly effective. Good tone control, but the image lacks in overall impact with respect to the theme of the challenge. If there were a little sharper with better focus, it would have worked well and been an excellant contribution. A good concept lacking in execution.</td>', 'A good concept, but the image is too softly focused to be truly effective. Good tone control, but the image lacks in overall impact with respect to the theme of the challenge. If there were a little sharper with better focus, it would have worked well and been an excellant contribution. A good concept lacking in execution.', '2009-04-08 21:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428030, 779503, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice tight crop, very detailed. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice tight crop, very detailed. Nicely done.', '2009-04-08 21:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428038, 780402, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would have worked much better with a sharper foreground fading to the background. The background needs less detail to be truly effective. A nice low level angle and a very good concept less than expertly executed. Average for this competition which has been excellant so far.</td>', 'This would have worked much better with a sharper foreground fading to the background. The background needs less detail to be truly effective. A nice low level angle and a very good concept less than expertly executed. Average for this competition which has been excellant so far.', '2009-04-08 21:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428040, 780403, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very good use of offset subject and blended DOF background. Good contrast on the flower and very interesting color difference between the background and foreground. Good detail, but it falls just a little short of demonstrating texture as a concept.</td>', 'Very good use of offset subject and blended DOF background. Good contrast on the flower and very interesting color difference between the background and foreground. Good detail, but it falls just a little short of demonstrating texture as a concept.', '2009-04-08 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428044, 779055, 101256, '<td valign="top">Elegant in it''s simplicity and the use of single color and shade make this a provocative image in a love it or hate it fashion. The use of water as texture provides an abstract feel to the image with the subtle shadows in the background providing some dimensionality. A good solid effort.</td>', 'Elegant in it''s simplicity and the use of single color and shade make this a provocative image in a love it or hate it fashion. The use of water as texture provides an abstract feel to the image with the subtle shadows in the background providing some dimensionality. A good solid effort.', '2009-04-08 21:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428046, 780065, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good color control which blend well together. The reversal of DOF is interesting and gives a left-to-right impression.  The water drops aren''t as effective as they should be because of the odd focusing. It might have been more interesting if the author could have done from smaller drops to larger or vice versa.  A good image though and a solid effort evoking the theme of texture very well.</td>', 'Good color control which blend well together. The reversal of DOF is interesting and gives a left-to-right impression.  The water drops aren''t as effective as they should be because of the odd focusing. It might have been more interesting if the author could have done from smaller drops to larger or vice versa.  A good image though and a solid effort evoking the theme of texture very well.', '2009-04-08 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428060, 780304, 105167, '<td valign="top">Floor Mat?</td>', 'Floor Mat?', '2009-04-08 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428086, 780308, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant flora image with solid lighting and DOF control. Curves and shapes demonstrate dimensionality, but the background has more texture and color which is pleasing to the eye than the subject. A good effort with the title, but a little lacking in execution.</td>', 'An excellant flora image with solid lighting and DOF control. Curves and shapes demonstrate dimensionality, but the background has more texture and color which is pleasing to the eye than the subject. A good effort with the title, but a little lacking in execution.', '2009-04-08 21:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428087, 780136, 103601, '<td valign="top">there is definitely nice texture in the center parts of the flower.. i forget what they are called.. stamen maybe?</td>', 'there is definitely nice texture in the center parts of the flower.. i forget what they are called.. stamen maybe?', '2009-04-08 21:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
