(5428131, 780491, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort demonstrating texture in the natural world. The author''s choice of lighting the subject was good, but a little more intense than necessary leading to a minor reflection onto the surface. There is also a slight slight green cast line in the foreground which can''t be explained easily by viewing.  The little white blooms aren''t a negative, but it would have helped to use a softer light.  The deep shade could have been effective if all the other factors mentioned were fixed.</td>', 'A good effort demonstrating texture in the natural world. The author''s choice of lighting the subject was good, but a little more intense than necessary leading to a minor reflection onto the surface. There is also a slight slight green cast line in the foreground which can''t be explained easily by viewing.  The little white blooms aren''t a negative, but it would have helped to use a softer light.  The deep shade could have been effective if all the other factors mentioned were fixed.', '2009-04-08 22:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428133, 780496, 98339, '<td valign="top">almost looks like a pencil plant...good colors and DOF</td>', 'almost looks like a pencil plant...good colors and DOF', '2009-04-08 22:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
