(5428201, 779128, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and provacative the simple elegance is a plus in demonstrating texture. An added bonus is the figured raised wood grain which expertly compliments the subject matter of the challenge.  A perfectly executed composition properly framed with pleasing angles in addition.  A worthy ribbon contender and certainly a top ten. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful and provacative the simple elegance is a plus in demonstrating texture. An added bonus is the figured raised wood grain which expertly compliments the subject matter of the challenge.  A perfectly executed composition properly framed with pleasing angles in addition.  A worthy ribbon contender and certainly a top ten. Well done.', '2009-04-08 22:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
