(5428210, 780503, 101256, '<td valign="top">If the foreground had been in focus with a drop off to the back or vice versa or from right to left or left to right this would have been a stunning image and would have effectively demonstrated man made texture. A good concept with a flawed execution. Having said that, it still works well and should score higher than average.</td>', 'If the foreground had been in focus with a drop off to the back or vice versa or from right to left or left to right this would have been a stunning image and would have effectively demonstrated man made texture. A good concept with a flawed execution. Having said that, it still works well and should score higher than average.', '2009-04-08 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
