(5428634, 780311, 64568, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. great focus and lovely browns. Random orientation of subject matter like this make it stand out from the rest. Hope it does well. Added to fav''s.</td>', 'Wonderful. great focus and lovely browns. Random orientation of subject matter like this make it stand out from the rest. Hope it does well. Added to fav''s.', '2009-04-09 06:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428661, 779091, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very unique and effective presentation - the single salt grains and pleasing textures presented in neutral tones is unusual in that it carries through the entire image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very unique and effective presentation - the single salt grains and pleasing textures presented in neutral tones is unusual in that it carries through the entire image.  Nicely done.', '2009-04-09 07:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428662, 779744, 101256, '<td valign="top">The right on the edge of overdone sun is very distracting. It might have been a better choice to crop the image and just concentrate on the wind ripples across the water. If cropped, it would also be unique in that the rose tone compliments the yellow of the sun''s reflections.</td>', 'The right on the edge of overdone sun is very distracting. It might have been a better choice to crop the image and just concentrate on the wind ripples across the water. If cropped, it would also be unique in that the rose tone compliments the yellow of the sun''s reflections.', '2009-04-09 07:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428663, 779752, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of definition demonstrating texture - the image is too soft and unfocused.  The nominal presentation and simple angle is effective, it''s just that the subject is much to bland to be of any use.</td>', 'Not a lot of definition demonstrating texture - the image is too soft and unfocused.  The nominal presentation and simple angle is effective, it''s just that the subject is much to bland to be of any use.', '2009-04-09 07:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428665, 779214, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has a good eye for shape, color and combining the two into an effective image. The slight offset with a complimentary background offers a pleasing image to the eye and is entirely within the contraints of the challenge with variable shapes containing their own detail. Well done.</td>', 'The author has a good eye for shape, color and combining the two into an effective image. The slight offset with a complimentary background offers a pleasing image to the eye and is entirely within the contraints of the challenge with variable shapes containing their own detail. Well done.', '2009-04-09 07:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428672, 779477, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has taken a unigue look at a common object and used a very different DOF technique to express texture. It''s a perfect step towards the top with a sharp begining at the bottom, a slight fade and subtle tonal shift followed by another followed by another.  The use of grain to help create the effect is very clever. The polychromic color cast is also a plus. This should place high as it''s a very interesting image. Well done.</td>', 'The author has taken a unigue look at a common object and used a very different DOF technique to express texture. It''s a perfect step towards the top with a sharp begining at the bottom, a slight fade and subtle tonal shift followed by another followed by another.  The use of grain to help create the effect is very clever. The polychromic color cast is also a plus. This should place high as it''s a very interesting image. Well done.', '2009-04-09 07:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428682, 780213, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very abstract in concept and execution. It could have used a little more focus as the fine detail of the barbs are lost in the overall neutral color tone of the image when viewed normally on a monitor. Standing back from the image improves it''s over all impact significantly which would indicate that a more macro style lens would have been a better choice.</td>', 'Very abstract in concept and execution. It could have used a little more focus as the fine detail of the barbs are lost in the overall neutral color tone of the image when viewed normally on a monitor. Standing back from the image improves it''s over all impact significantly which would indicate that a more macro style lens would have been a better choice.', '2009-04-09 07:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428690, 780471, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice, wish it was a tad sharper.  A 6.</td>', 'Nice, wish it was a tad sharper.  A 6.', '2009-04-09 07:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428693, 780527, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort, but the subject leads the eye away from the pleasing textures and interesting details of the stone wall and wood.  A good black and white conversion.</td>', 'A good effort, but the subject leads the eye away from the pleasing textures and interesting details of the stone wall and wood.  A good black and white conversion.', '2009-04-09 07:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428694, 780266, 101256, '<td valign="top">A pleasing blend of color and an interesting offset which is very effective. This might have been improved by using better lighting as there is a slight grain that is annoying - not quite as crisp and sharp as it could be. A good effort.</td>', 'A pleasing blend of color and an interesting offset which is very effective. This might have been improved by using better lighting as there is a slight grain that is annoying - not quite as crisp and sharp as it could be. A good effort.', '2009-04-09 07:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428695, 780360, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good control of the color and background. Interesting features on the leaves demonstrating texture in nature. A little short of having an immediate visual impact - the image seems to lack purpose and intent.</td>', 'Good control of the color and background. Interesting features on the leaves demonstrating texture in nature. A little short of having an immediate visual impact - the image seems to lack purpose and intent.', '2009-04-09 07:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428697, 780021, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellant control of green complimented by the yellow flowers. Wonderful and varied texture viewed at a unigue angle. The offset and image angle are very complimentary. Overall an excellant effort and a challanger for a top ten finish if not a ribbon.</td>', 'Excellant control of green complimented by the yellow flowers. Wonderful and varied texture viewed at a unigue angle. The offset and image angle are very complimentary. Overall an excellant effort and a challanger for a top ten finish if not a ribbon.', '2009-04-09 07:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428699, 779989, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author had a great idea and concept. Unfortunately, the image falls short of the overall idea as the image isn''t clean with an odd DOF. It might have helped to back off in focal length to capture more area, then crop out the sharpest area for presentation. The lighting didn''t help either producing unattractive light blooms.</td>', 'The author had a great idea and concept. Unfortunately, the image falls short of the overall idea as the image isn''t clean with an odd DOF. It might have helped to back off in focal length to capture more area, then crop out the sharpest area for presentation. The lighting didn''t help either producing unattractive light blooms.', '2009-04-09 07:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428703, 778834, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good treatment of texture of nature. A little less light or exposure would have made the image pop right out of the screen. The complimentary background is a plus. A solid effort.</td>', 'A very good treatment of texture of nature. A little less light or exposure would have made the image pop right out of the screen. The complimentary background is a plus. A solid effort.', '2009-04-09 07:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428753, 780330, 101256, '<td valign="top">Delicate in both color and texture. The image would have been better served by a full on capture with a subtle fade to the edges rather than the odd offset and questionable DOF used. This approach would have allowed for enhancing the pleasure of viewing such a simple, delicate object.</td>', 'Delicate in both color and texture. The image would have been better served by a full on capture with a subtle fade to the edges rather than the odd offset and questionable DOF used. This approach would have allowed for enhancing the pleasure of viewing such a simple, delicate object.', '2009-04-09 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428757, 780481, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant presentation of a difficult subject. Nicely focused showing natural details and textures. A complimentary background enhances the overall impact. A very good entry into the challenge and worthy of a top 25.</td>', 'An excellant presentation of a difficult subject. Nicely focused showing natural details and textures. A complimentary background enhances the overall impact. A very good entry into the challenge and worthy of a top 25.', '2009-04-09 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428759, 779365, 101256, '<td valign="top">A macro shot that is right on the edge of being excellant. Unfortunately, the water reflection creates a false shadow area area that detracts from the foreground. A solid effort just shy of good execution.</td>', 'A macro shot that is right on the edge of being excellant. Unfortunately, the water reflection creates a false shadow area area that detracts from the foreground. A solid effort just shy of good execution.', '2009-04-09 09:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428762, 779025, 103601, '<td valign="top">the red is great and i love the lines</td>', 'the red is great and i love the lines', '2009-04-09 09:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428763, 780528, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant conversion to grayscale with good detail and DOF control - it presents as a graphite pencil drawing which is difficult to produce. A worthy entry and a top contender.</td>', 'An excellant conversion to grayscale with good detail and DOF control - it presents as a graphite pencil drawing which is difficult to produce. A worthy entry and a top contender.', '2009-04-09 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428767, 780496, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good idea that is well constructed and presented. No major flaws and it demonstrates natural texture in a very subtle way. Interesting use of DOF control to produce an effective, vague yet detailed background. A solid effort and very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'A good idea that is well constructed and presented. No major flaws and it demonstrates natural texture in a very subtle way. Interesting use of DOF control to produce an effective, vague yet detailed background. A solid effort and very pleasing to the eye.', '2009-04-09 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
