(5428803, 779536, 101256, '<td valign="top">The only fruit in the world with it''s own packaging, the transitions from fruit to skin is excellant. A notable aspect is the skin strings hanging delicately off in the air and still attached almost as a bridge to the fruit. A complimentary background enhances the overall effect and is very pleasing to the eye.  A great image, simple and purposeful at the same time. Well done.</td>', 'The only fruit in the world with it''s own packaging, the transitions from fruit to skin is excellant. A notable aspect is the skin strings hanging delicately off in the air and still attached almost as a bridge to the fruit. A complimentary background enhances the overall effect and is very pleasing to the eye.  A great image, simple and purposeful at the same time. Well done.', '2009-04-09 09:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428806, 779579, 103601, '<td valign="top">to me it looks like the image is tilted slightly clockwise, but it has to be an illusion. it''s pretty cool. to explain better, the frame at the top looks like the left side is more narrow than the right side. anyway, the processing looks good, but the image doesn''t really do much for me</td>', 'to me it looks like the image is tilted slightly clockwise, but it has to be an illusion. it''s pretty cool. to explain better, the frame at the top looks like the left side is more narrow than the right side. anyway, the processing looks good, but the image doesn''t really do much for me', '2009-04-09 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
