(5428810, 779852, 101256, '<td valign="top">The use of grayscale to demonstrate the textures of well worn books is very inventive and works well. Very different textures from top to bottom - artistic presenting a very pleasing aesthetic impression. The top and bottom framing enhance the overall impression positively. Well done - a contender for sure.</td>', 'The use of grayscale to demonstrate the textures of well worn books is very inventive and works well. Very different textures from top to bottom - artistic presenting a very pleasing aesthetic impression. The top and bottom framing enhance the overall impression positively. Well done - a contender for sure.', '2009-04-09 09:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
