(5428867, 780391, 103601, '<td valign="top">looks like nature''s barbed wire. love the lines</td>', 'looks like nature''s barbed wire. love the lines', '2009-04-09 10:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428868, 780538, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach to the challenge subject matter. The contrasting nature of smooth fish scales and spiny urchins is a good concept. It would have been difficult to focus in more on the two creatures as a contrast, but this works as it is. A good entry.</td>', 'An interesting approach to the challenge subject matter. The contrasting nature of smooth fish scales and spiny urchins is a good concept. It would have been difficult to focus in more on the two creatures as a contrast, but this works as it is. A good entry.', '2009-04-09 10:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428870, 780360, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp, great contrast. a slightly less shallow dof might be nice so the part on the right is still in focus, but that''s just personal preference :)</td>', 'nice and sharp, great contrast. a slightly less shallow dof might be nice so the part on the right is still in focus, but that''s just personal preference :)', '2009-04-09 10:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428871, 779809, 103601, '<td valign="top">excellent processing</td>', 'excellent processing', '2009-04-09 10:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428872, 779784, 103601, '<td valign="top">i have no idea what this is, but it''s cool</td>', 'i have no idea what this is, but it''s cool', '2009-04-09 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428873, 779954, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract with many features to appeal to the eye. The intersting angles are pleasing to the eye. Very simple, but complex at the same time - a perfect example of natural texture. The image does not appear to be forced in any way. Good control of the greens and whites. A very good entry.</td>', 'Abstract with many features to appeal to the eye. The intersting angles are pleasing to the eye. Very simple, but complex at the same time - a perfect example of natural texture. The image does not appear to be forced in any way. Good control of the greens and whites. A very good entry.', '2009-04-09 10:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428874, 779072, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting view point which might have been improved by changing the angle to create some dynamic tension. Interesting features, well focused with a minor issue with DOF. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting view point which might have been improved by changing the angle to create some dynamic tension. Interesting features, well focused with a minor issue with DOF. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428875, 779267, 101256, '<td valign="top">A perfect demonstration of various textures from gentle curves to smooth surfaces to highly figured feathers. A very apt title which works well with the image.  The highlights are a little over done interrupting the smooth flow of color and texture in the folds of the satin in the foreground. Otherwise an excellant entry and worthy of a top fifteen entry and possibly a top ten.</td>', 'A perfect demonstration of various textures from gentle curves to smooth surfaces to highly figured feathers. A very apt title which works well with the image.  The highlights are a little over done interrupting the smooth flow of color and texture in the folds of the satin in the foreground. Otherwise an excellant entry and worthy of a top fifteen entry and possibly a top ten.', '2009-04-09 10:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428878, 779809, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic and highly figured, a terrific natural world capture. Nothing seems out of place or over done. Apt title compliments the image. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Very dramatic and highly figured, a terrific natural world capture. Nothing seems out of place or over done. Apt title compliments the image. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428879, 780346, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sure fire top ten entry and a very likely ribbon winner. Perfect composition in many ways - too many to detail.  The author should be very proud of this image as it is an excellant demonstration of proper lighting, subject matter and composition/framing execution highlighting the variable nature of texture.</td>', 'A sure fire top ten entry and a very likely ribbon winner. Perfect composition in many ways - too many to detail.  The author should be very proud of this image as it is an excellant demonstration of proper lighting, subject matter and composition/framing execution highlighting the variable nature of texture.', '2009-04-09 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428881, 780547, 101256, '<td valign="top">Provacative and interesting - an abstract in every sense with interesting details scattered about the image. As a texture shot, it''s marginal, but the intent is there and it is a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Provacative and interesting - an abstract in every sense with interesting details scattered about the image. As a texture shot, it''s marginal, but the intent is there and it is a good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428882, 780494, 103601, '<td valign="top">great contrast</td>', 'great contrast', '2009-04-09 10:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428883, 780301, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever title conveying the overall sense of the image. Minor little negative detail in the light fade at the top left of the image and there is too much foreground to be truly effective with impact. If the bottom were cropped out and the top given a slightly different treatment - even a minor crop, it would be a top 25 image.</td>', 'A clever title conveying the overall sense of the image. Minor little negative detail in the light fade at the top left of the image and there is too much foreground to be truly effective with impact. If the bottom were cropped out and the top given a slightly different treatment - even a minor crop, it would be a top 25 image.', '2009-04-09 10:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428888, 780105, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice eye for changing details from color to DOF. Natural texture from the center image towards the back with the gentle fade is very pleasing to the eye.  A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A nice eye for changing details from color to DOF. Natural texture from the center image towards the back with the gentle fade is very pleasing to the eye.  A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428890, 780048, 101256, '<td valign="top">A interesting approach to the challenge subject. The image works on several levels from layering the sky with branches to the details of the tree trunk. The image from a color standpoint is a little flat and could use a little tweaking to make it pop. A solid entry. Nice concept.</td>', 'A interesting approach to the challenge subject. The image works on several levels from layering the sky with branches to the details of the tree trunk. The image from a color standpoint is a little flat and could use a little tweaking to make it pop. A solid entry. Nice concept.', '2009-04-09 10:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428894, 780277, 101256, '<td valign="top">A visually pleasing presentation of corragated steel. The plywood panel is an excellant contrast to the to the steel. The background is complimentary to the subject matter and has it''s own texture to add to the image as does the foreground. The steel appears to be right on the edge of being over sharpened. A worthy top 20 contender and possibly a top ten.</td>', 'A visually pleasing presentation of corragated steel. The plywood panel is an excellant contrast to the to the steel. The background is complimentary to the subject matter and has it''s own texture to add to the image as does the foreground. The steel appears to be right on the edge of being over sharpened. A worthy top 20 contender and possibly a top ten.', '2009-04-09 10:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428897, 780485, 103601, '<td valign="top">ah, an out of the box texture shot. feels soft. nice job</td>', 'ah, an out of the box texture shot. feels soft. nice job', '2009-04-09 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428898, 779478, 103601, '<td valign="top">that is some awesome detail and the whiskers make for some nice background blur</td>', 'that is some awesome detail and the whiskers make for some nice background blur', '2009-04-09 10:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428900, 780081, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully abstract - very simple with subtle tones and shapes. Little tiny spots only enhance the sense of texture, but could be seen as a flaw affecting the overall asthetic. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderfully abstract - very simple with subtle tones and shapes. Little tiny spots only enhance the sense of texture, but could be seen as a flaw affecting the overall asthetic. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428905, 780462, 103601, '<td valign="top">there appears to be a slight halo around the building, it''s sort of distracting for me</td>', 'there appears to be a slight halo around the building, it''s sort of distracting for me', '2009-04-09 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428907, 779658, 101256, '<td valign="top">The effective use of foreground to frame the image is a plus. Rich in detail with interesting changes in color and shape. A solid entry and possible top ten contender if one looks past the flatish nature of the image.</td>', 'The effective use of foreground to frame the image is a plus. Rich in detail with interesting changes in color and shape. A solid entry and possible top ten contender if one looks past the flatish nature of the image.', '2009-04-09 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428908, 779953, 103601, '<td valign="top">before i realized it was 2 elephants, i thought it was a some sort of horned sea monster. that''s besides the point, nice texture</td>', 'before i realized it was 2 elephants, i thought it was a some sort of horned sea monster. that''s besides the point, nice texture', '2009-04-09 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428910, 779337, 101256, '<td valign="top">No it''s not - it''s baseball season. :&gt;) A well controlled concept and almost perfect execution of same. The edges of the lace white are over done but the eye is drawn to the pigskin first which lessens the white''s impact. Properly focused and a complimentary background. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'No it''s not - it''s baseball season. :>) A well controlled concept and almost perfect execution of same. The edges of the lace white are over done but the eye is drawn to the pigskin first which lessens the white''s impact. Properly focused and a complimentary background. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428913, 780329, 101256, '<td valign="top">The fade from the foreground is distracting and the image is too tall to be truly effective with respect to the title. If the bottom were cropped off the improvement would be significant. A good effort lacking in execution.</td>', 'The fade from the foreground is distracting and the image is too tall to be truly effective with respect to the title. If the bottom were cropped off the improvement would be significant. A good effort lacking in execution.', '2009-04-09 10:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428915, 780449, 101256, '<td valign="top">Much to flat to be effective.  The image could use more contrast to bring out the details.</td>', 'Much to flat to be effective.  The image could use more contrast to bring out the details.', '2009-04-09 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428918, 780080, 103601, '<td valign="top">oops, i left a comment about cloning, which i don''t think you could do in a basic challenge... so disregard that (i wonder if it''ll be replaced by this one) ;)</td>', 'oops, i left a comment about cloning, which i don''t think you could do in a basic challenge... so disregard that (i wonder if it''ll be replaced by this one) ;)', '2009-04-09 10:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428921, 780164, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author avoided the temptation to make the image taller than necessary and that is a significant plus. The little spots of color enhance the figured beach sand and the background is properly composed and presented increasing the images effectiveness. There is an even more effective image if the top were cropped out presenting only the beach sand. Either way, it''s a solid entry into the challenge effectively demonstrating natural world texture. A possible top ten, certainly a top 25.</td>', 'The author avoided the temptation to make the image taller than necessary and that is a significant plus. The little spots of color enhance the figured beach sand and the background is properly composed and presented increasing the images effectiveness. There is an even more effective image if the top were cropped out presenting only the beach sand. Either way, it''s a solid entry into the challenge effectively demonstrating natural world texture. A possible top ten, certainly a top 25.', '2009-04-09 10:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428923, 780048, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice display of texture but it looks a little bit flat to me</td>', 'nice display of texture but it looks a little bit flat to me', '2009-04-09 10:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428924, 779506, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is amazing. one of my favorites in the challenge for sure</td>', 'this is amazing. one of my favorites in the challenge for sure', '2009-04-09 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428925, 780545, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clever and highly amusing - an image using texture to convey a sense of fun and self awareness perfectly executed. A sure fire blue ribbon contender and a personal favorite. Well done.</td>', 'Very clever and highly amusing - an image using texture to convey a sense of fun and self awareness perfectly executed. A sure fire blue ribbon contender and a personal favorite. Well done.', '2009-04-09 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428926, 778995, 98339, '<td valign="top">very pretty colors, your background really shows off the texture well</td>', 'very pretty colors, your background really shows off the texture well', '2009-04-09 10:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428927, 779116, 103601, '<td valign="top">very cool shot, nice texture in the street</td>', 'very cool shot, nice texture in the street', '2009-04-09 10:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428930, 780418, 103601, '<td valign="top">awesome! i''m very fond of the background colors</td>', 'awesome! i''m very fond of the background colors', '2009-04-09 10:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428931, 779178, 98339, '<td valign="top">Rough to smooth...really like the hand picture...and that it is in B&amp;W looks good</td>', 'Rough to smooth...really like the hand picture...and that it is in B&W looks good', '2009-04-09 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428933, 780536, 101256, '<td valign="top">Stunning color, the barbs of the feathers are rich in detail and the background is simple and highly complimentary to the subject matter. A minor little flaw with the slightly overdone white blooms, but those are not immediately noticed and only on review do they appear. A top ten image for sure and a possible ribbon contender. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning color, the barbs of the feathers are rich in detail and the background is simple and highly complimentary to the subject matter. A minor little flaw with the slightly overdone white blooms, but those are not immediately noticed and only on review do they appear. A top ten image for sure and a possible ribbon contender. Well done.', '2009-04-09 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428934, 779373, 98339, '<td valign="top">that almost looks painted...just a tad dark</td>', 'that almost looks painted...just a tad dark', '2009-04-09 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428936, 780052, 103601, '<td valign="top">contrast and colors are great. the frame is a bit much for me, i''d prefer it black or white, or just black.</td>', 'contrast and colors are great. the frame is a bit much for me, i''d prefer it black or white, or just black.', '2009-04-09 10:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428938, 780420, 98339, '<td valign="top">is your sensor dirty...top left corner?  or is that plant dust coming off?</td>', 'is your sensor dirty...top left corner?  or is that plant dust coming off?', '2009-04-09 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428940, 779752, 103601, '<td valign="top">while it certainly meets the challenge, it looks a bit flat and feels like a snapshot for me. maybe a different angle or different lighting could''ve helped a bit</td>', 'while it certainly meets the challenge, it looks a bit flat and feels like a snapshot for me. maybe a different angle or different lighting could''ve helped a bit', '2009-04-09 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428943, 780339, 101256, '<td valign="top">An apt title. A little larger than necessary. Subtle texture changes which are a plus. It wouldn''t have hurt the image to crop the top to the waterline and would have improved the overall impact. Excellant color control and the shadows are not over done.  The temptation to increase the shapes by over sharpening was avoided. A worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An apt title. A little larger than necessary. Subtle texture changes which are a plus. It wouldn''t have hurt the image to crop the top to the waterline and would have improved the overall impact. Excellant color control and the shadows are not over done.  The temptation to increase the shapes by over sharpening was avoided. A worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 10:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428950, 779528, 98339, '<td valign="top">quite aged hands...definitely shows texture...just a little dark</td>', 'quite aged hands...definitely shows texture...just a little dark', '2009-04-09 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428952, 780324, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very inventive concept just a little shy of being perfectly executed. If the foreground were a little sharper with less DOF, it would have worked some special magic. As it stands, it''s a wonderful concept and should be repeated as soon as a challenge subject suitable to the concept comes up. This would work extremely well if the DOF were controlled from sharp to gently faded background. A slightly different angle would help.</td>', 'A very inventive concept just a little shy of being perfectly executed. If the foreground were a little sharper with less DOF, it would have worked some special magic. As it stands, it''s a wonderful concept and should be repeated as soon as a challenge subject suitable to the concept comes up. This would work extremely well if the DOF were controlled from sharp to gently faded background. A slightly different angle would help.', '2009-04-09 10:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428953, 780027, 103601, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, i love the yellow background</td>', 'interesting shot, i love the yellow background', '2009-04-09 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428955, 780503, 98339, '<td valign="top">yum, yum...love blue cheese...would not have thought of that...good idea</td>', 'yum, yum...love blue cheese...would not have thought of that...good idea', '2009-04-09 10:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428957, 780208, 103601, '<td valign="top">it fits the challenge well, and the color adds a little something. i like it</td>', 'it fits the challenge well, and the color adds a little something. i like it', '2009-04-09 10:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428958, 779993, 101256, '<td valign="top">An extremely diffucult image to pull off and the author has done a great job with the subject matter. Variable details from round to linear show off the textures of the natural world in spectacular fashion. Great background control. A very worthy image for the challenge and should be a top 25 image.</td>', 'An extremely diffucult image to pull off and the author has done a great job with the subject matter. Variable details from round to linear show off the textures of the natural world in spectacular fashion. Great background control. A very worthy image for the challenge and should be a top 25 image.', '2009-04-09 10:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428961, 780470, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice shot, might benefit from a little more sharpening</td>', 'nice shot, might benefit from a little more sharpening', '2009-04-09 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428963, 780539, 103601, '<td valign="top">awesome. a fave for me</td>', 'awesome. a fave for me', '2009-04-09 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428965, 779637, 98339, '<td valign="top">don''t really know what to say...it is just a bit dark IMO</td>', 'don''t really know what to say...it is just a bit dark IMO', '2009-04-09 10:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428969, 778949, 98339, '<td valign="top">very pretty color...I so love Tulip Trees they are something from my childhood....</td>', 'very pretty color...I so love Tulip Trees they are something from my childhood....', '2009-04-09 10:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428973, 779884, 103601, '<td valign="top">cool tree, but the blown out background takes away from it a bit for me.</td>', 'cool tree, but the blown out background takes away from it a bit for me.', '2009-04-09 10:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428980, 780467, 98339, '<td valign="top">step away from the gator!!!  I am going to assume that this is cropped...if not you need counseling...great color and focus...just WAY to close...hmmm</td>', 'step away from the gator!!!  I am going to assume that this is cropped...if not you need counseling...great color and focus...just WAY to close...hmmm', '2009-04-09 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428981, 779957, 103601, '<td valign="top">the buildings are awesome colors. i feel like the foreground needs a little something or maybe the shot should''ve been taken from closer to the ground?</td>', 'the buildings are awesome colors. i feel like the foreground needs a little something or maybe the shot should''ve been taken from closer to the ground?', '2009-04-09 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428984, 779655, 98339, '<td valign="top">this definitely has texture...good color</td>', 'this definitely has texture...good color', '2009-04-09 10:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428986, 779644, 103601, '<td valign="top">you managed to take an everyday object and make it interesting. nice work with the processing</td>', 'you managed to take an everyday object and make it interesting. nice work with the processing', '2009-04-09 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428987, 779931, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic. love the colors and detail</td>', 'this is fantastic. love the colors and detail', '2009-04-09 10:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428989, 780402, 98339, '<td valign="top">this does show texture, but if you had narrowed your field of vision you could have cut the car out on the left and the house on the right...and picky me (I''m quite OCD)...I would have straightened the light in the center.</td>', 'this does show texture, but if you had narrowed your field of vision you could have cut the car out on the left and the house on the right...and picky me (I''m quite OCD)...I would have straightened the light in the center.', '2009-04-09 11:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428991, 779849, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like how you desaturated it, and the texture is cool. i''d like it if the dof was a little less shallow so more of the leaf(?) was in focus</td>', 'i like how you desaturated it, and the texture is cool. i''d like it if the dof was a little less shallow so more of the leaf(?) was in focus', '2009-04-09 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428992, 779392, 98339, '<td valign="top">the lights and shadows throw this off...IMO I would have cropped out the upper bright spot and worked with your exposure more...</td>', 'the lights and shadows throw this off...IMO I would have cropped out the upper bright spot and worked with your exposure more...', '2009-04-09 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428997, 779042, 98339, '<td valign="top">your shot does show texture...but...IMO (which doesn''t count for anything) you could have gotten the point across with less building...I guess the centering of the door is what is bothering me...to centered...if you cut off almost 1/2 the door and kept the window to the right it would have more appeal to me...</td>', 'your shot does show texture...but...IMO (which doesn''t count for anything) you could have gotten the point across with less building...I guess the centering of the door is what is bothering me...to centered...if you cut off almost 1/2 the door and kept the window to the right it would have more appeal to me...', '2009-04-09 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5428999, 779465, 98339, '<td valign="top">you are right about the silkiness, wouldn''t have thought of this at all...good idea</td>', 'you are right about the silkiness, wouldn''t have thought of this at all...good idea', '2009-04-09 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429002, 778831, 98339, '<td valign="top">definitely shows texture, your lighting is good...it just lacks a wow factor...sorry</td>', 'definitely shows texture, your lighting is good...it just lacks a wow factor...sorry', '2009-04-09 11:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429005, 780277, 98339, '<td valign="top">what on earth is this used for???  the area looks so stark and rough..hmmm  very good lighting and color</td>', 'what on earth is this used for???  the area looks so stark and rough..hmmm  very good lighting and color', '2009-04-09 11:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429007, 779645, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like this...bricks and stucco...like your colors too...very pleasing</td>', 'I like this...bricks and stucco...like your colors too...very pleasing', '2009-04-09 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429011, 779661, 103601, '<td valign="top">while there is texture here, i''m not sure it''s the primary focus. interesting shot though, i love the color.</td>', 'while there is texture here, i''m not sure it''s the primary focus. interesting shot though, i love the color.', '2009-04-09 11:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429012, 780107, 103601, '<td valign="top">cool macro, very creative</td>', 'cool macro, very creative', '2009-04-09 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
