(5429085, 779402, 96664, '<td valign="top">And this must be roz...</td>', 'And this must be roz...', '2009-04-09 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429104, 779750, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image unfortunately the fence breaks up all the interesting things going on with the horse. As a texture image it just misses the mark. The author should revist this sans fence for a future challenge.</td>', 'A good image unfortunately the fence breaks up all the interesting things going on with the horse. As a texture image it just misses the mark. The author should revist this sans fence for a future challenge.', '2009-04-09 12:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429110, 779503, 101256, '<td valign="top">Intense and beautiful - plenty of diffeent textures and detail. Unfortunate that the red on the bag pipe is just a touch overdone. That particular section also appears to be over done color saturation wise. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Intense and beautiful - plenty of diffeent textures and detail. Unfortunate that the red on the bag pipe is just a touch overdone. That particular section also appears to be over done color saturation wise. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429115, 780051, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever title exactly matching the impression left by the image. The subtle light and detail of the leaf against the plain background is inspired - can''t think of a better way to do it. Well done and a clear contender for a top ten if not a ribbon.</td>', 'Clever title exactly matching the impression left by the image. The subtle light and detail of the leaf against the plain background is inspired - can''t think of a better way to do it. Well done and a clear contender for a top ten if not a ribbon.', '2009-04-09 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429120, 780017, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well with this as it is, but a sharper image would bring out the excellant detail and interesting shapes against the perfect background. A good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The soft focus works well with this as it is, but a sharper image would bring out the excellant detail and interesting shapes against the perfect background. A good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-09 12:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429122, 780515, 101256, '<td valign="top">A lack of DOF control hurts this image which would otherwise be a ribbon contender. A little more attention to the details of a macro shot would have improved this image tremendously.</td>', 'A lack of DOF control hurts this image which would otherwise be a ribbon contender. A little more attention to the details of a macro shot would have improved this image tremendously.', '2009-04-09 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429127, 779579, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of DOF to create a sharp image from corner to corner with subtle soft focus on the opposite corner.  The little black framing top and bottom serve this image well. A very interesting side effect of the way the image is presented is of a trapazoid even though the image is straight - a very effective treatment and one that needs further exploration by the author.  If this were a challenge for Unigue View, this would be a sure bet for a ribbon. As it is, it''s a good entry into the challenge - forthright and purposeful.</td>', 'Interesting use of DOF to create a sharp image from corner to corner with subtle soft focus on the opposite corner.  The little black framing top and bottom serve this image well. A very interesting side effect of the way the image is presented is of a trapazoid even though the image is straight - a very effective treatment and one that needs further exploration by the author.  If this were a challenge for Unigue View, this would be a sure bet for a ribbon. As it is, it''s a good entry into the challenge - forthright and purposeful.', '2009-04-09 12:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429130, 779100, 101256, '<td valign="top">If the author had used DOF preview, the need for a little better composition would have been self evident. The intent is there, the image just lacks in execution because of the lost details in the soft focus areas. A little more thought and concentration would have produced a clear favorite for a top ten finish.</td>', 'If the author had used DOF preview, the need for a little better composition would have been self evident. The intent is there, the image just lacks in execution because of the lost details in the soft focus areas. A little more thought and concentration would have produced a clear favorite for a top ten finish.', '2009-04-09 12:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429131, 779663, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not as effective as it could be, but it does demonstrate the nature of natural fiber texture. An interesting concept just a little short on execution.</td>', 'Not as effective as it could be, but it does demonstrate the nature of natural fiber texture. An interesting concept just a little short on execution.', '2009-04-09 12:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429135, 780282, 101256, '<td valign="top">A confused image lacking context with respect to the challenge.  The grainy effect does not assist this image in any way. A snapshot quality image which isn''t bad, but not up to the specifications of the challenge.</td>', 'A confused image lacking context with respect to the challenge.  The grainy effect does not assist this image in any way. A snapshot quality image which isn''t bad, but not up to the specifications of the challenge.', '2009-04-09 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429139, 780475, 101256, '<td valign="top">The cage could have been used more effectively with a closer shot. The author could also have adjusted for the cage by creating a frame for the image of texture concentrating on the silver feathers. A good concept just a little shy of being interesting.</td>', 'The cage could have been used more effectively with a closer shot. The author could also have adjusted for the cage by creating a frame for the image of texture concentrating on the silver feathers. A good concept just a little shy of being interesting.', '2009-04-09 12:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429140, 778950, 101256, '<td valign="top">A case where the central focus works and the side to side DOF if effective in bringing out the colors. A good entry into the challenge and worthy of consideration.</td>', 'A case where the central focus works and the side to side DOF if effective in bringing out the colors. A good entry into the challenge and worthy of consideration.', '2009-04-09 12:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429141, 779571, 103601, '<td valign="top">the colors are quite interesting and it definitely gives a feeling of texture</td>', 'the colors are quite interesting and it definitely gives a feeling of texture', '2009-04-09 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429143, 780339, 103601, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape and successful portrayal of texture</td>', 'beautiful landscape and successful portrayal of texture', '2009-04-09 12:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429146, 779677, 103601, '<td valign="top">i love all the parallel lines</td>', 'i love all the parallel lines', '2009-04-09 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429147, 780485, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent is plain from the title, unfortunately, the uber soft focus doens''t meet the title''s expectations. The image, while soft, isn''t delicate as the title could imply - it requires more detail in particular with the object in the back ground which assumedly is a cat.</td>', 'The author''s intent is plain from the title, unfortunately, the uber soft focus doens''t meet the title''s expectations. The image, while soft, isn''t delicate as the title could imply - it requires more detail in particular with the object in the back ground which assumedly is a cat.', '2009-04-09 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429151, 779884, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of texture and color, but the washed out over lit background affects the subject in a negative way. A good concept a little short on execution.</td>', 'Interesting mix of texture and color, but the washed out over lit background affects the subject in a negative way. A good concept a little short on execution.', '2009-04-09 12:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429155, 779511, 101256, '<td valign="top">Soft and figured the subject is lit correctly. A better image would have produced zero DOF allowing for more detail and capturing the change in curvature of the petals. A interesting effect with the smooth surface, curves and clear round water drops. A good entry with respect to the challenge parameters.</td>', 'Soft and figured the subject is lit correctly. A better image would have produced zero DOF allowing for more detail and capturing the change in curvature of the petals. A interesting effect with the smooth surface, curves and clear round water drops. A good entry with respect to the challenge parameters.', '2009-04-09 12:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429158, 780539, 101256, '<td valign="top">Grain without being grainy - a very intriguing concept. The blank sky hurts the image by being over stark and contrasty. It would be difficult to suggest a better crop because it would ruin the overall effect.</td>', 'Grain without being grainy - a very intriguing concept. The blank sky hurts the image by being over stark and contrasty. It would be difficult to suggest a better crop because it would ruin the overall effect.', '2009-04-09 12:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429165, 779349, 101256, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image and a favorite so far. Strong and purposeful human figure indicating the elements of hard work as evidenced by the texture of the hand skin contrasting with the more linear hair on the forearm. A wonderful concept and excellant execution. Not a favorite, but very close. Well done.</td>', 'Outstanding image and a favorite so far. Strong and purposeful human figure indicating the elements of hard work as evidenced by the texture of the hand skin contrasting with the more linear hair on the forearm. A wonderful concept and excellant execution. Not a favorite, but very close. Well done.', '2009-04-09 12:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429169, 780142, 101256, '<td valign="top">The lighting was not the friend of this intriguing image. Shooting into the light produced some odd features and ever so subtle over exposed whites. A possible solution would have been to use a fill flash technique to bring out the various hues, color and linear/curves textures of the background to the pine cone.  A good effort just a little shy on the execution.</td>', 'The lighting was not the friend of this intriguing image. Shooting into the light produced some odd features and ever so subtle over exposed whites. A possible solution would have been to use a fill flash technique to bring out the various hues, color and linear/curves textures of the background to the pine cone.  A good effort just a little shy on the execution.', '2009-04-09 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429176, 779042, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific conversion richly detailed making for a impressive presentation. The various forms and shapes are are intriguing and the combination of linear door and benches against the more figured wall makes a good combination. Demonstrates the variable nature of texture. A good solid effort.</td>', 'A terrific conversion richly detailed making for a impressive presentation. The various forms and shapes are are intriguing and the combination of linear door and benches against the more figured wall makes a good combination. Demonstrates the variable nature of texture. A good solid effort.', '2009-04-09 12:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429180, 779634, 101256, '<td valign="top">Subtle color cast and the very hard to capture whites. A slight crop of the left cutting out the background would have enhanced this image. The linear aspects of the cart frames combined with the variable shape of the snow work well. A good solid effort meeting the specification of the challenge.</td>', 'Subtle color cast and the very hard to capture whites. A slight crop of the left cutting out the background would have enhanced this image. The linear aspects of the cart frames combined with the variable shape of the snow work well. A good solid effort meeting the specification of the challenge.', '2009-04-09 12:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429186, 780280, 101256, '<td valign="top">Smooth can be texture by definition and this image demonstrates that very well. Unfortunately, the overly dark rocks hurt the image - this might have worked better if converted to black and white and then adjusted using the zone system. A good effort.</td>', 'Smooth can be texture by definition and this image demonstrates that very well. Unfortunately, the overly dark rocks hurt the image - this might have worked better if converted to black and white and then adjusted using the zone system. A good effort.', '2009-04-09 12:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429253, 780030, 80104, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge.  The lighting is great, the feel of a single color from the tree trunks and roots... It''s just a fantastic image.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge.  The lighting is great, the feel of a single color from the tree trunks and roots... It''s just a fantastic image.', '2009-04-09 12:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429255, 778921, 80104, '<td valign="top">Love this shot...  It''s really really well done.</td>', 'Love this shot...  It''s really really well done.', '2009-04-09 12:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
