(5429413, 780355, 101256, '<td valign="top">The light shadow compliments the hand shape - very creative. Good eye on the texture of the hand. A slight red scale halo effect probably the result of reflection off the background used. A minor issue with the DOF on the top part of the hand, but the author may have intended it to be that way. A good solid effort and meets the specification of the challenge.</td>', 'The light shadow compliments the hand shape - very creative. Good eye on the texture of the hand. A slight red scale halo effect probably the result of reflection off the background used. A minor issue with the DOF on the top part of the hand, but the author may have intended it to be that way. A good solid effort and meets the specification of the challenge.', '2009-04-09 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
