(5429807, 779660, 66398, '<td valign="top">Quite a few of these guys in the fauna challenge. Works for this one too though. The flower in the foreground bothers me just a bit. Looks like this guy lost part of his wing too I just noticed.</td>', 'Quite a few of these guys in the fauna challenge. Works for this one too though. The flower in the foreground bothers me just a bit. Looks like this guy lost part of his wing too I just noticed.', '2009-04-09 19:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
