(5429811, 779465, 66398, '<td valign="top">nice morning or evening light you captured there. Looks like this home was abandoned?</td>', 'nice morning or evening light you captured there. Looks like this home was abandoned?', '2009-04-09 19:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429814, 780016, 66398, '<td valign="top">nice shimmery material.</td>', 'nice shimmery material.', '2009-04-09 19:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429816, 780501, 66398, '<td valign="top">but he looks like a happy fun loving guy.</td>', 'but he looks like a happy fun loving guy.', '2009-04-09 19:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429819, 780319, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh my eyes... I can feel them tearing up already.</td>', 'Oh my eyes... I can feel them tearing up already.', '2009-04-09 19:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429825, 780345, 66398, '<td valign="top">The overblown top left corner is a little distracting.  A bit more dof could help this one as well as some curve adjustments.</td>', 'The overblown top left corner is a little distracting.  A bit more dof could help this one as well as some curve adjustments.', '2009-04-09 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429836, 780182, 66398, '<td valign="top">The challenge is texture and though there is some here I''m drawn to his gloves because of the color. Texture doesn''t seem to be the subject of this photo except that he works with texture. I''m not saying dnmc but a shot of the fresh laid cement with the leveler working it from rough to smooth might have been a better shot for the challenge. If I were to see this shot without knowing the what the challenge was then I wouldn''t think texture.</td>', 'The challenge is texture and though there is some here I''m drawn to his gloves because of the color. Texture doesn''t seem to be the subject of this photo except that he works with texture. I''m not saying dnmc but a shot of the fresh laid cement with the leveler working it from rough to smooth might have been a better shot for the challenge. If I were to see this shot without knowing the what the challenge was then I wouldn''t think texture.', '2009-04-09 20:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429838, 779852, 66398, '<td valign="top">And well shot. Very nice job.</td>', 'And well shot. Very nice job.', '2009-04-09 20:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429842, 780194, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not spectacular but not bad. A little more contrast might help.</td>', 'Not spectacular but not bad. A little more contrast might help.', '2009-04-09 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429843, 780267, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun.</td>', 'Looks like fun.', '2009-04-09 20:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429846, 780133, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit weathered huh? Makes me want to see the dates on it.</td>', 'Looks a bit weathered huh? Makes me want to see the dates on it.', '2009-04-09 20:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429849, 780532, 66398, '<td valign="top">Some diffusion would help minimize that bright spot. Or maybe if you cropped that out so we can focus on the beautiful pattern in the rock/marble blue thing.</td>', 'Some diffusion would help minimize that bright spot. Or maybe if you cropped that out so we can focus on the beautiful pattern in the rock/marble blue thing.', '2009-04-09 20:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429851, 780092, 66398, '<td valign="top">Too much border I think. This is great for texture but I''d like to see it bigger and maybe just a bit sharper.</td>', 'Too much border I think. This is great for texture but I''d like to see it bigger and maybe just a bit sharper.', '2009-04-09 20:12:12.000000', NULL, 1);
