(5430096, 779506, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I''m not sure how I missed it on my first run through where I picked out the ones I thought were the best in the challenge. I''m putting you in with my top 20 and giving a 7 but I''ll be back to evaluate again. Gotta compare you to my top 3 choices.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I''m not sure how I missed it on my first run through where I picked out the ones I thought were the best in the challenge. I''m putting you in with my top 20 and giving a 7 but I''ll be back to evaluate again. Gotta compare you to my top 3 choices.', '2009-04-10 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
