(5430938, 780349, 98647, '<td valign="top">The best ''bark'' shot in this challenge for me. Nicely lit and well framed with the green at the top and bottom.</td>', 'The best ''bark'' shot in this challenge for me. Nicely lit and well framed with the green at the top and bottom.', '2009-04-10 17:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
