(5430974, 779900, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good example of texture, but the grayscale treatment doesn''t do it justice. A good effort demonstrating texture.</td>', 'A good example of texture, but the grayscale treatment doesn''t do it justice. A good effort demonstrating texture.', '2009-04-10 17:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430977, 780354, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting 3D effect and subtle color make this a solid entry into the challenge. What the subject has in shapes, textures and colors, lacks just something to create some interest.</td>', 'An interesting 3D effect and subtle color make this a solid entry into the challenge. What the subject has in shapes, textures and colors, lacks just something to create some interest.', '2009-04-10 17:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430986, 780516, 101256, '<td valign="top">The zig zag effect creates an interesting illusion and the more linear shadows at the bottom of the image give some dimension and has some interest.</td>', 'The zig zag effect creates an interesting illusion and the more linear shadows at the bottom of the image give some dimension and has some interest.', '2009-04-10 17:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430988, 780524, 101256, '<td valign="top">The odd shape of the object created an interesting DOF effect that is very interesting. The colors and shapes make this a worthy entry into the texture challenge.</td>', 'The odd shape of the object created an interesting DOF effect that is very interesting. The colors and shapes make this a worthy entry into the texture challenge.', '2009-04-10 17:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430990, 780319, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would have been a very outside the norm image if the detail of the onion had carried through to the right side of the onion. The odd lighting bleached out the detail. The lighting needed to be better controled to reduce the odd sparkles from the onion juice on the left. The image does workk well with the background.</td>', 'This would have been a very outside the norm image if the detail of the onion had carried through to the right side of the onion. The odd lighting bleached out the detail. The lighting needed to be better controled to reduce the odd sparkles from the onion juice on the left. The image does workk well with the background.', '2009-04-10 17:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430993, 779573, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much blank space which detracts from the subject. The shadow on the bottom of the image is a negative. This would have worked much better with at least a third cropped off the top of the image to increase the impact of the subject matter.</td>', 'Too much blank space which detracts from the subject. The shadow on the bottom of the image is a negative. This would have worked much better with at least a third cropped off the top of the image to increase the impact of the subject matter.', '2009-04-10 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430996, 780211, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice absract concept - the author thought this out and composed it properly with solid DOF control and not over exposing the object to light. A very worthy entry into the challenge and should be a 25 image.</td>', 'A nice absract concept - the author thought this out and composed it properly with solid DOF control and not over exposing the object to light. A very worthy entry into the challenge and should be a 25 image.', '2009-04-10 18:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431000, 780510, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent with respect to titling the submission is a good concept. This is a hard image to rate if only because the overly white tone and slightly over done white blooms. It might have scored better with the rather vague bottom third cropped out.</td>', 'The author''s intent with respect to titling the submission is a good concept. This is a hard image to rate if only because the overly white tone and slightly over done white blooms. It might have scored better with the rather vague bottom third cropped out.', '2009-04-10 18:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431002, 780170, 101256, '<td valign="top">A top submission illustrating the variable nature of texture with a very elegant and simple entry. No major flaws and it''s initent is clear. A great entry into the challenge and worthy of top ten consideration.</td>', 'A top submission illustrating the variable nature of texture with a very elegant and simple entry. No major flaws and it''s initent is clear. A great entry into the challenge and worthy of top ten consideration.', '2009-04-10 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431004, 780555, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but the image is too small and not detailed enough to score higher. If it were larger with a little more interest, it would be a good solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but the image is too small and not detailed enough to score higher. If it were larger with a little more interest, it would be a good solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-10 18:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431005, 780328, 101256, '<td valign="top">A difficult angle to work with, but the DOF control is excellant. The image does demonstrate texture is various ways, but it feels flat and uninteresting.</td>', 'A difficult angle to work with, but the DOF control is excellant. The image does demonstrate texture is various ways, but it feels flat and uninteresting.', '2009-04-10 18:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431006, 780463, 101256, '<td valign="top">A variety of shapes and colors. The washed out white detracts from the image''s overall impact and the details in the carrot slices are missing. A little more lighting control to reduce the white spots created by reflecting the light would have helped. A unique presentation which falls just a little short.</td>', 'A variety of shapes and colors. The washed out white detracts from the image''s overall impact and the details in the carrot slices are missing. A little more lighting control to reduce the white spots created by reflecting the light would have helped. A unique presentation which falls just a little short.', '2009-04-10 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431008, 780036, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice clean image with a delicate sweep of focused area deftly treated with a clever use of DOF. The highly figured leaf only enhances the image''s impact on the viewer. This should be a top twenty image and certainly a worthy contender for a ribbon.</td>', 'A nice clean image with a delicate sweep of focused area deftly treated with a clever use of DOF. The highly figured leaf only enhances the image''s impact on the viewer. This should be a top twenty image and certainly a worthy contender for a ribbon.', '2009-04-10 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431010, 780509, 101256, '<td valign="top">A beautiful object, properly control DOF, a subtle contrasting background and rich detail make this a top ten image if only because of it''s simplicity and elegance. A different look at a figured object demonstrating texuture.</td>', 'A beautiful object, properly control DOF, a subtle contrasting background and rich detail make this a top ten image if only because of it''s simplicity and elegance. A different look at a figured object demonstrating texuture.', '2009-04-10 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431014, 780006, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever use of different materials to create a out of the box composition, but it fails to properly address the subject challenge. The joke might have worked a little better if the lighting had been better controlled.</td>', 'A clever use of different materials to create a out of the box composition, but it fails to properly address the subject challenge. The joke might have worked a little better if the lighting had been better controlled.', '2009-04-10 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431015, 780405, 101256, '<td valign="top">The gentle monotone effect with subtle whites and the subject''s natural grain make this a sure fire top ten image and should be a solid, if not actual, ribbon winner. A terrific composition showing the natural texture of natural wood.  Well done.</td>', 'The gentle monotone effect with subtle whites and the subject''s natural grain make this a sure fire top ten image and should be a solid, if not actual, ribbon winner. A terrific composition showing the natural texture of natural wood.  Well done.', '2009-04-10 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431016, 780409, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perhaps the author intended something unusual which is not being properly addressed in this composition. It is so out of the norm that normal would seem to be outrageous. Given the subject matter of the challenge, this just doesn''t make sense.</td>', 'Perhaps the author intended something unusual which is not being properly addressed in this composition. It is so out of the norm that normal would seem to be outrageous. Given the subject matter of the challenge, this just doesn''t make sense.', '2009-04-10 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431018, 780075, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant example of how to control light in highly reflective conditions.  The snow is not overly white and the author avoided the temptation to add a overly blue cast to the snow to bring out it''s features. A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An excellant example of how to control light in highly reflective conditions.  The snow is not overly white and the author avoided the temptation to add a overly blue cast to the snow to bring out it''s features. A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-10 18:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431020, 780495, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever juxtaposition of different textures and if the image had a little more color and less contrast, it would have been a top ten challenger if only because of the unique subject matter.</td>', 'A clever juxtaposition of different textures and if the image had a little more color and less contrast, it would have been a top ten challenger if only because of the unique subject matter.', '2009-04-10 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431021, 779848, 101256, '<td valign="top">The unfortunate white highlights are a defect that negatively impacts the image and it''s intent. A little less exposure and a little closer focal length would have eliminated the branches in the foreground which are distrracting and do nothing to enhance this image.</td>', 'The unfortunate white highlights are a defect that negatively impacts the image and it''s intent. A little less exposure and a little closer focal length would have eliminated the branches in the foreground which are distrracting and do nothing to enhance this image.', '2009-04-10 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431026, 780185, 101256, '<td valign="top">A perfect idea with just a few minor flaws. The odd lighting angle slightly washed out the bottom images in comparison to the top - the author may have intended this, but it just quite doesn''t make the image more interesting. The benefit of the doubt much be part of the deliberation and in this case, the benefit goes to the author. Well done.</td>', 'A perfect idea with just a few minor flaws. The odd lighting angle slightly washed out the bottom images in comparison to the top - the author may have intended this, but it just quite doesn''t make the image more interesting. The benefit of the doubt much be part of the deliberation and in this case, the benefit goes to the author. Well done.', '2009-04-10 18:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431027, 779655, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and very provacative the varying textures and simple color tone control make this an outstanding entry into the challenge.  A worthy contender for a top ten finish and a potential ribbon contender.  Well done.</td>', 'Simple and very provacative the varying textures and simple color tone control make this an outstanding entry into the challenge.  A worthy contender for a top ten finish and a potential ribbon contender.  Well done.', '2009-04-10 18:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431028, 779793, 101256, '<td valign="top">Rich in detail, excellant DOF control and perfect green color control. The highly figured subject is a delightful demonstration of texture in the natural world.  A worthy ribbon contender.</td>', 'Rich in detail, excellant DOF control and perfect green color control. The highly figured subject is a delightful demonstration of texture in the natural world.  A worthy ribbon contender.', '2009-04-10 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431031, 780353, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very clever concept presented with a certain senes of humor. A little less blue would have enhanced the effect and a crop of the top third would only positively affect and improve the overall concept. A worthy entry into the texture challenge.</td>', 'A very clever concept presented with a certain senes of humor. A little less blue would have enhanced the effect and a crop of the top third would only positively affect and improve the overall concept. A worthy entry into the texture challenge.', '2009-04-10 18:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431034, 780473, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting grayscale presentation - effective use of grain and lighting control. A solid entry into the competition, but lacking in visual appeal.</td>', 'An interesting grayscale presentation - effective use of grain and lighting control. A solid entry into the competition, but lacking in visual appeal.', '2009-04-10 18:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431036, 780163, 101256, '<td valign="top">A perfect title reflecting the impact of the image on the viewer which the author obviously intended.  No major flaws or defects make this a certain top-ten image and should be a ribbon contender.</td>', 'A perfect title reflecting the impact of the image on the viewer which the author obviously intended.  No major flaws or defects make this a certain top-ten image and should be a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-10 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
