(5431288, 780555, 69046, '<td valign="top">Has anyone mentioned this is small yet?</td>', 'Has anyone mentioned this is small yet?', '2009-04-10 22:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431307, 780006, 58683, '<td valign="top">This is cute, and a nice idea that doesn''t quite work for me. The first thing that occurs to me is that the background really doesn''t do much for the photo. The texture, both on the fruit and the hat does come through though.</td>', 'This is cute, and a nice idea that doesn''t quite work for me. The first thing that occurs to me is that the background really doesn''t do much for the photo. The texture, both on the fruit and the hat does come through though.', '2009-04-10 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431311, 780527, 58683, '<td valign="top">As a portrait shot I actually really like this, and I see a few of elements in the photo that have interesting textures. Unfortunately though it really doesn''t communicate the theme to me as dramatically as other photos in the challenge and as a result gets a slightly lower score from me.</td>', 'As a portrait shot I actually really like this, and I see a few of elements in the photo that have interesting textures. Unfortunately though it really doesn''t communicate the theme to me as dramatically as other photos in the challenge and as a result gets a slightly lower score from me.', '2009-04-10 22:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431318, 780450, 58683, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours out the window, and the contrast between the wall and the scene outside is very well done. Texture (wall and broken glass) seems to be a lesser part of this shot though.</td>', 'Lovely colours out the window, and the contrast between the wall and the scene outside is very well done. Texture (wall and broken glass) seems to be a lesser part of this shot though.', '2009-04-10 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431320, 779573, 58683, '<td valign="top">This shot really needs to be in a lot closer for me. The shadow directly under is also a bit distracting.</td>', 'This shot really needs to be in a lot closer for me. The shadow directly under is also a bit distracting.', '2009-04-10 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431326, 780048, 58683, '<td valign="top">The pattern of the branches against the sky in the shot is really well done. I like that part of the photo a lot (one more point on review). The texture of the bark though just doesn''t jump out as much as I''d like though.</td>', 'The pattern of the branches against the sky in the shot is really well done. I like that part of the photo a lot (one more point on review). The texture of the bark though just doesn''t jump out as much as I''d like though.', '2009-04-10 23:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431331, 779392, 58683, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject and could have scored much higher from me if you had approached the lighting a bit differently. Particularly since it looks pretty sharp. The texture is just lost a little bit since it all looks quite flat in the shade. Shame. I like the title.</td>', 'Very interesting subject and could have scored much higher from me if you had approached the lighting a bit differently. Particularly since it looks pretty sharp. The texture is just lost a little bit since it all looks quite flat in the shade. Shame. I like the title.', '2009-04-10 23:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431341, 779750, 58683, '<td valign="top">Having this shot from behind the fence really doesn''t work for me. I think you chose a great subject (and the top of his head seems to have plenty of spiky texture to work with) but needed to approach this slightly differently.</td>', 'Having this shot from behind the fence really doesn''t work for me. I think you chose a great subject (and the top of his head seems to have plenty of spiky texture to work with) but needed to approach this slightly differently.', '2009-04-10 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431343, 779848, 58683, '<td valign="top">To me, this is crying out for a closer shot, perhaps even just a tighter crop on some of the wet rocks.</td>', 'To me, this is crying out for a closer shot, perhaps even just a tighter crop on some of the wet rocks.', '2009-04-10 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431438, 780503, 104198, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Idea....The bread alone would have done it for me!</td>', 'Wonderful Idea....The bread alone would have done it for me!', '2009-04-11 00:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431445, 778867, 103142, '<td valign="top">Haha! I almost entered one of these as well! What is it? (people have told me different things, but I haven''t bothered looking it up yet)</td>', 'Haha! I almost entered one of these as well! What is it? (people have told me different things, but I haven''t bothered looking it up yet)', '2009-04-11 00:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431480, 780345, 102315, '<td valign="top">Is this a belt. I like the idea, just wish more of the photo was in better focus.</td>', 'Is this a belt. I like the idea, just wish more of the photo was in better focus.', '2009-04-11 01:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431481, 778966, 102315, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. I like the focus on the canvas''s texture. Draw''s your eyes to it and that''s what this challenge is about.</td>', 'I really like this one. I like the focus on the canvas''s texture. Draw''s your eyes to it and that''s what this challenge is about.', '2009-04-11 01:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
