(5431484, 779988, 102315, '<td valign="top">Left the same comment for someone else but it also applies to this one. Good example of texture. Seems like this could be microscopic.</td>', 'Left the same comment for someone else but it also applies to this one. Good example of texture. Seems like this could be microscopic.', '2009-04-11 01:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
