(5432112, 779647, 101256, '<td valign="top">Different and unusual a good treatment of the challenge subject. The right side could have been cropped without impacting the image at all. A little more color and better focus control would also have helped.</td>', 'Different and unusual a good treatment of the challenge subject. The right side could have been cropped without impacting the image at all. A little more color and better focus control would also have helped.', '2009-04-11 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432114, 779757, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and properly captured demonstrating texture in the natural world. The complimentary background treatment enhances the overall impact of the image. A beautiful image that should be a top ten contender if not a prize winner.</td>', 'Well thought out and properly captured demonstrating texture in the natural world. The complimentary background treatment enhances the overall impact of the image. A beautiful image that should be a top ten contender if not a prize winner.', '2009-04-11 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432118, 780224, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author might have done better to concentrate on one of the rabbits to get the maximum effect with respect to the subject challenge. A little less lighting would have helped also. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The author might have done better to concentrate on one of the rabbits to get the maximum effect with respect to the subject challenge. A little less lighting would have helped also. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432120, 780274, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and very effective treatment given the corner to corner focus treatment. Nice color control with no significant flaws. A touch over done on the bottom left with the soft focus, but overall a worthy entry into the challenge and a worthy of placement in the top thirty if not top twenty.</td>', 'Simple and very effective treatment given the corner to corner focus treatment. Nice color control with no significant flaws. A touch over done on the bottom left with the soft focus, but overall a worthy entry into the challenge and a worthy of placement in the top thirty if not top twenty.', '2009-04-11 17:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432123, 780375, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp, this entry doesn''t quite meet the challenge, but the author''s intent was clear. A good portrait and the curly nature of the hair complies with the subject matter, unfortunately a little too dense and lacking in interest.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp, this entry doesn''t quite meet the challenge, but the author''s intent was clear. A good portrait and the curly nature of the hair complies with the subject matter, unfortunately a little too dense and lacking in interest.', '2009-04-11 17:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432125, 780027, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little on the bland side, but subject does match the challenge subject. Nicely controlled green, but the different lighting approach lacks impact. A good entry into the challenge, just a little short of being properly executed.</td>', 'A little on the bland side, but subject does match the challenge subject. Nicely controlled green, but the different lighting approach lacks impact. A good entry into the challenge, just a little short of being properly executed.', '2009-04-11 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432126, 779990, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author''s intent is clear and the treatment effective. It might have helped to have a little less exposure and perhaps darked up the image just a little to have the most impact of the feather shadow. From an artistsic standpoint, this is a very nice composition.</td>', 'The author''s intent is clear and the treatment effective. It might have helped to have a little less exposure and perhaps darked up the image just a little to have the most impact of the feather shadow. From an artistsic standpoint, this is a very nice composition.', '2009-04-11 17:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432128, 780337, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image with much to recommend it. The subtle color control and angled presentation make this a very intriguing image. Clear, crisp and without siginifant issues in any technical area. A worthy competitor for top twenty five honors.</td>', 'An image with much to recommend it. The subtle color control and angled presentation make this a very intriguing image. Clear, crisp and without siginifant issues in any technical area. A worthy competitor for top twenty five honors.', '2009-04-11 17:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432130, 780533, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good DOF control although it might have been bettere to back off the shot just a little to get more detail. The background doens''t necessarily add anything to the image, but it works efficiently. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Good DOF control although it might have been bettere to back off the shot just a little to get more detail. The background doens''t necessarily add anything to the image, but it works efficiently. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432133, 780453, 101256, '<td valign="top">This might have worked better if the author has concentrated on the curve and sweep of the water rather than try to split the image in two vertically. Alternatively, more of the white water or more of the falls would have helped, although the lack of detail in the former might have hurt. A good entry into the challenge by comparison.</td>', 'This might have worked better if the author has concentrated on the curve and sweep of the water rather than try to split the image in two vertically. Alternatively, more of the white water or more of the falls would have helped, although the lack of detail in the former might have hurt. A good entry into the challenge by comparison.', '2009-04-11 17:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432134, 780492, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic and technical success with one minor issue not worth mentioning. A worthy entry for top twenty five honors, the elegant simplicity evokes some of the Master''s.</td>', 'An artistic and technical success with one minor issue not worth mentioning. A worthy entry for top twenty five honors, the elegant simplicity evokes some of the Master''s.', '2009-04-11 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432137, 780036, 74979, '<td valign="top">the leaf alone carries so much content &amp; can almost smell the autumn leaf scent.<br/> <br/>the chain links give an odd but effective border although it takes away from the leafy texture by the time I get to the top of the frame, I think a closer crop would have better accentuated your idea</td>', 'the leaf alone carries so much content & can almost smell the autumn leaf scent. the chain links give an odd but effective border although it takes away from the leafy texture by the time I get to the top of the frame, I think a closer crop would have better accentuated your idea', '2009-04-11 17:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432138, 780295, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely wood, the curves and divots, make for interesting eye journey</td>', 'lovely wood, the curves and divots, make for interesting eye journey', '2009-04-11 17:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432139, 780410, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success with some minor technical flaws in what appear to be hot pixels which negatively impact the image. The contrast between smooth, nearly smooth and highly figured is a brilliant idea. A near miss for top ten honors and should place well in the top ten percent of the challenge.</td>', 'An artistic success with some minor technical flaws in what appear to be hot pixels which negatively impact the image. The contrast between smooth, nearly smooth and highly figured is a brilliant idea. A near miss for top ten honors and should place well in the top ten percent of the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432143, 779602, 101256, '<td valign="top">An intriguing idea which just falls short of being a top placing image. The texture demonstation is fine, the image just lacks interest to the viewer. A little tighter on the chick would have helped a lot along with better DOF control</td>', 'An intriguing idea which just falls short of being a top placing image. The texture demonstation is fine, the image just lacks interest to the viewer. A little tighter on the chick would have helped a lot along with better DOF control', '2009-04-11 17:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432145, 779570, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image with some aspects of artistic success, but some significant flaws from a technical standpoint. It would have been better to concentrate on the sweeping curve and provide more detail of that particularly interesting area. Under proper control, the DOF would have helped rather than hurt this effort and made is a solid contender for top placement in the challenge.</td>', 'An image with some aspects of artistic success, but some significant flaws from a technical standpoint. It would have been better to concentrate on the sweeping curve and provide more detail of that particularly interesting area. Under proper control, the DOF would have helped rather than hurt this effort and made is a solid contender for top placement in the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432149, 780541, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting treatment, but the overly bland appearance of the subject is uninteresting which is a negative. A blend of some artistic and technical aspects, it is a good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting treatment, but the overly bland appearance of the subject is uninteresting which is a negative. A blend of some artistic and technical aspects, it is a good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432150, 779955, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and color control make this a top contender for a ribbon and certainly a top ten finisher. Elegant and simple, this demonstrates the challenge subject is speactular fashion.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and color control make this a top contender for a ribbon and certainly a top ten finisher. Elegant and simple, this demonstrates the challenge subject is speactular fashion.', '2009-04-11 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432156, 779836, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good and different entry into the challenge, the image prodived both aspects of technical and artistic success. The image does have the apperance of being slightly over sharpened on the vertical axis of the stake. An ingenious approach and a good action shot make this a worthy entry into the challenge with top twenty potential.</td>', 'A good and different entry into the challenge, the image prodived both aspects of technical and artistic success. The image does have the apperance of being slightly over sharpened on the vertical axis of the stake. An ingenious approach and a good action shot make this a worthy entry into the challenge with top twenty potential.', '2009-04-11 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432158, 780554, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and a sense of whimsy in the title give this impact and in many ways is pleasing to the eye. A technical success given how the subject was treated, but from an artistic standpoint, falls a little short of being interesting.</td>', 'Nicely captured and a sense of whimsy in the title give this impact and in many ways is pleasing to the eye. A technical success given how the subject was treated, but from an artistic standpoint, falls a little short of being interesting.', '2009-04-11 17:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432178, 780112, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image that demonstates the subject matter of the challenge in spectacular fashion with excellant DOF and color control. Both a technical and artistic success that more than adequately meets the challenge subject in particular with the green shades. A minor flaw in the title although the author may have intended it to be that way. A very worthy contender for top ten honors and a possible ribbon contender.</td>', 'An image that demonstates the subject matter of the challenge in spectacular fashion with excellant DOF and color control. Both a technical and artistic success that more than adequately meets the challenge subject in particular with the green shades. A minor flaw in the title although the author may have intended it to be that way. A very worthy contender for top ten honors and a possible ribbon contender.', '2009-04-11 17:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432179, 780083, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technical success from the slightly out of focus background which compliments the crips and detailed foreground and subject. A little shy on having any significant artistic impact. Excellant control of the white areas which give the appearance of bleaching, but not losing any details.  A solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A technical success from the slightly out of focus background which compliments the crips and detailed foreground and subject. A little shy on having any significant artistic impact. Excellant control of the white areas which give the appearance of bleaching, but not losing any details.  A solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432180, 779660, 101256, '<td valign="top">A technical success, the artistic issues have a significant impact. The petals of the flowers obscure the area that is important to the overall flow of the image and they interrupt the more interesting features of the butterfly. A good entry into the challenge which falls just short of being a top finisher.</td>', 'A technical success, the artistic issues have a significant impact. The petals of the flowers obscure the area that is important to the overall flow of the image and they interrupt the more interesting features of the butterfly. A good entry into the challenge which falls just short of being a top finisher.', '2009-04-11 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432181, 780334, 101256, '<td valign="top">An artistic success, the over exposed whites detract from the impact that the image should have had. This technical flaw could have been corrected with a slight change in exposure time. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An artistic success, the over exposed whites detract from the impact that the image should have had. This technical flaw could have been corrected with a slight change in exposure time. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
