(5432535, 779119, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus and less over done DOF would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus and less over done DOF would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 22:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432536, 779617, 101256, '<td valign="top">A heck of an idea and one of the better concepts of the challenge, unfortunately it falls short of being equally stellar as the idea. Over exposed washing out the natural tans of aged cheese. A good effort, but with a little more thought and a proper light setting, it would have been a sure fire entry into the top twenty if not a winner.</td>', 'A heck of an idea and one of the better concepts of the challenge, unfortunately it falls short of being equally stellar as the idea. Over exposed washing out the natural tans of aged cheese. A good effort, but with a little more thought and a proper light setting, it would have been a sure fire entry into the top twenty if not a winner.', '2009-04-11 23:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432538, 780267, 101256, '<td valign="top">The water shapes are lost in an overly busy image that could have been a very interesting entry into the challenge. The textures, while meeting the challenge successfully, are too broad in the sense that they over establish a presence and over power the entire image including the subject. An earlier capture or even a later capture in the splash process would have probaly helped the image tremendosly. A good entry into the challenge, it could have been better and with the right treatment, a top twenty image.</td>', 'The water shapes are lost in an overly busy image that could have been a very interesting entry into the challenge. The textures, while meeting the challenge successfully, are too broad in the sense that they over establish a presence and over power the entire image including the subject. An earlier capture or even a later capture in the splash process would have probaly helped the image tremendosly. A good entry into the challenge, it could have been better and with the right treatment, a top twenty image.', '2009-04-11 23:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432539, 778711, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. The slight offset is a plus, but the background distracts from the natural texture of the hay bale. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. The slight offset is a plus, but the background distracts from the natural texture of the hay bale. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432540, 779400, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge - very abstract and different.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge - very abstract and different.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432541, 778833, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge - very abstract and different.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'An interesting choice for meeting the subject challenge - very abstract and different.  The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432543, 780136, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has chosen a interesting subject and it almost works - very abstract and different. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher with it''s combination of detail and blank space. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The author has chosen a interesting subject and it almost works - very abstract and different. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher with it''s combination of detail and blank space. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432544, 779394, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A different DOF treatment would have been a better choice in that more avlinear approach to DOF either from the foreground to the background or vice versa may have been better. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The image could be a little more dramatic. A little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A different DOF treatment would have been a better choice in that more avlinear approach to DOF either from the foreground to the background or vice versa may have been better. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432545, 779532, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image could be a little more dramatic. It''s composed well enough and the subject is clear and detailed, but it''s not close enough to really impact the viewer and the DOF is too detailed to allow the subject to jump out at you. If the author intended to use the background as a texture, a little different angle would have been a better choice. Alternatively,  little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The image could be a little more dramatic. It''s composed well enough and the subject is clear and detailed, but it''s not close enough to really impact the viewer and the DOF is too detailed to allow the subject to jump out at you. If the author intended to use the background as a texture, a little different angle would have been a better choice. Alternatively,  little more focus would have helped this image score higher. A good, solid entry into the challenge.', '2009-04-11 23:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432547, 779604, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful - plenty of detail and the subtle contrast with the background is perfect. A demonstration of how the combination of texture and color work in the natural world. This could have gone very wrong, but instead it went exactly right. A sure fire top ten contender and very possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Simply beautiful - plenty of detail and the subtle contrast with the background is perfect. A demonstration of how the combination of texture and color work in the natural world. This could have gone very wrong, but instead it went exactly right. A sure fire top ten contender and very possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-11 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432548, 779957, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little less foreground and more concentration on the building and colors would have been a much better choice given the challenge subject. The foreground lacks detail that it should have given how the image was composed and shot.</td>', 'A little less foreground and more concentration on the building and colors would have been a much better choice given the challenge subject. The foreground lacks detail that it should have given how the image was composed and shot.', '2009-04-11 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432549, 780471, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful - plenty of detail and the subtle contrast with the background is perfect. A demonstration of how the combination of texture and color work in the natural world. This could have gone very wrong, but instead it went exactly right. A sure fire top ten contender and very possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.</td>', 'Simply beautiful - plenty of detail and the subtle contrast with the background is perfect. A demonstration of how the combination of texture and color work in the natural world. This could have gone very wrong, but instead it went exactly right. A sure fire top ten contender and very possibly a ribbon winner. Well done.', '2009-04-11 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432550, 780535, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstractly abstract in an abstract genre of abstract photography bordering on abstract art imparting an abstract feel with abstract color blending imparting abstract texture. Can you smell what the commenter is cooking? :&gt;)<br/> <br/>A brilliant image and if this commentator had anything to say about it, would win a blue ribbon hands down - no competition. Brilliantly executed and concieved. What an image. Unfortunate that it can''t be rated 10++.</td>', 'Abstractly abstract in an abstract genre of abstract photography bordering on abstract art imparting an abstract feel with abstract color blending imparting abstract texture. Can you smell what the commenter is cooking? :>) A brilliant image and if this commentator had anything to say about it, would win a blue ribbon hands down - no competition. Brilliantly executed and concieved. What an image. Unfortunate that it can''t be rated 10++.', '2009-04-11 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432551, 779571, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another brilliant composition worthy of a top prize if not the blue ribbon. richly detailed with unbelievable impact, this is clearly an outstanding effort on the part of the author. Perfect juxtaposition of rust and paint, it is simply perfect - can''t say enough about the raw beauty here. A top notch effort on the part of the author.  Well done.</td>', 'Another brilliant composition worthy of a top prize if not the blue ribbon. richly detailed with unbelievable impact, this is clearly an outstanding effort on the part of the author. Perfect juxtaposition of rust and paint, it is simply perfect - can''t say enough about the raw beauty here. A top notch effort on the part of the author.  Well done.', '2009-04-11 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5432552, 779528, 101256, '<td valign="top">An image that demonstates the subject matter of the challenge in spectacular fashion with excellant DOF and color control. Both a technical and artistic success that more than adequately meets the challenge subject in particular with the color shades. A very worthy contender for top ten honors and a possible ribbon contender.</td>', 'An image that demonstates the subject matter of the challenge in spectacular fashion with excellant DOF and color control. Both a technical and artistic success that more than adequately meets the challenge subject in particular with the color shades. A very worthy contender for top ten honors and a possible ribbon contender.', '2009-04-11 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
