(5433208, 780006, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like how you spiced up the shot of an orange with the cute face. it doesn''t detract from the texture but it adds a lot. the glare on his right eye is a little distracting, i wonder if a polarizer could have helped, or maybe you used one and that''s why it''s only a little distracting and not very distracting ;)</td>', 'i like how you spiced up the shot of an orange with the cute face. it doesn''t detract from the texture but it adds a lot. the glare on his right eye is a little distracting, i wonder if a polarizer could have helped, or maybe you used one and that''s why it''s only a little distracting and not very distracting ;)', '2009-04-12 17:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5433211, 780538, 103601, '<td valign="top">i''ve struggled with photographing fish before, so i appreciate how difficult a shot like this can be. looks great to me. also, looks like he''s about to enjoy a tasty snack</td>', 'i''ve struggled with photographing fish before, so i appreciate how difficult a shot like this can be. looks great to me. also, looks like he''s about to enjoy a tasty snack', '2009-04-12 17:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
