(5436054, 780079, 80104, '<td valign="top">The photo doesn''t seem to have much definition.  Wish the ripples were less soft.</td>', 'The photo doesn''t seem to have much definition.  Wish the ripples were less soft.', '2009-04-14 07:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436055, 779992, 80104, '<td valign="top">Lots of noise in this photo, especially the background.  The subjects also seem noisy.  Nothing spectacular about the shot.  Nice crop though.</td>', 'Lots of noise in this photo, especially the background.  The subjects also seem noisy.  Nothing spectacular about the shot.  Nice crop though.', '2009-04-14 07:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436056, 780085, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but it doesn''t do much for me.  Too abstract for my taste.</td>', 'Interesting shot but it doesn''t do much for me.  Too abstract for my taste.', '2009-04-14 07:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436057, 778834, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I originally gave this a 3 and I don''t know why looking at it again it''s a 6 for sure.  Very sharp and well done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I originally gave this a 3 and I don''t know why looking at it again it''s a 6 for sure.  Very sharp and well done.', '2009-04-14 07:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436058, 779025, 80104, '<td valign="top">This shot although it meets the challenge does nothing for me.  Nothing spectacular about it.</td>', 'This shot although it meets the challenge does nothing for me.  Nothing spectacular about it.', '2009-04-14 07:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436059, 780083, 80104, '<td valign="top">The shot just doesn''t do anything for me.  THe background seems more distracting than anything else and the subject doesn''t seem intriging.  It''s a little soft as well.</td>', 'The shot just doesn''t do anything for me.  THe background seems more distracting than anything else and the subject doesn''t seem intriging.  It''s a little soft as well.', '2009-04-14 07:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436060, 779595, 80104, '<td valign="top">if this shot is of the moon then I know how hard they are to take.  It looks more like a fruit being processed in B&amp;W but the noise is way too high in this shot and the focus is very soft where there is actually any definition(the lighter colored area.)  The darker area has no real definition and it seems pointless to focus there imo.</td>', 'if this shot is of the moon then I know how hard they are to take.  It looks more like a fruit being processed in B&W but the noise is way too high in this shot and the focus is very soft where there is actually any definition(the lighter colored area.)  The darker area has no real definition and it seems pointless to focus there imo.', '2009-04-14 07:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436062, 780282, 80104, '<td valign="top">Seems very pixilated and not sharp.  However interesting to see you got a shot when you got the cat peeking out from behind the broom.</td>', 'Seems very pixilated and not sharp.  However interesting to see you got a shot when you got the cat peeking out from behind the broom.', '2009-04-14 07:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436063, 780402, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF but I would have much preferred to see a different angle on this one.  The upper half of the picture really does nothing for this one.  Maybe even having the DOF much closer to the camera.</td>', 'Interesting DOF but I would have much preferred to see a different angle on this one.  The upper half of the picture really does nothing for this one.  Maybe even having the DOF much closer to the camera.', '2009-04-14 07:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436065, 779637, 80104, '<td valign="top">Looks like crinkled paper?  Well recreated but the photo really has nothing eye catching for me.  The texture seems very uninteresting.</td>', 'Looks like crinkled paper?  Well recreated but the photo really has nothing eye catching for me.  The texture seems very uninteresting.', '2009-04-14 07:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436066, 779777, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture.  Nothing really eye catching and it does seem noisy.  I believe the border does help this shot a little.</td>', 'Interesting texture.  Nothing really eye catching and it does seem noisy.  I believe the border does help this shot a little.', '2009-04-14 07:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436068, 779084, 80104, '<td valign="top">Moon pictures are really hard to take.  Especially in perfect focus.  You''ve done better than I but the shot really still doesn''t work for me.  Kind of wished it was a bit less blury.  Nice try and keep taking shots of the moon.</td>', 'Moon pictures are really hard to take.  Especially in perfect focus.  You''ve done better than I but the shot really still doesn''t work for me.  Kind of wished it was a bit less blury.  Nice try and keep taking shots of the moon.', '2009-04-14 07:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436069, 780311, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I had given it a 3 at first but over a second view it deserves a higher score of 4. I wish there was a subject sticking out from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I had given it a 3 at first but over a second view it deserves a higher score of 4. I wish there was a subject sticking out from the rest of the photo.', '2009-04-14 08:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436070, 780004, 80104, '<td valign="top">The photo needs more contrast and needs more focus.  It''s very soft.</td>', 'The photo needs more contrast and needs more focus.  It''s very soft.', '2009-04-14 08:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436072, 779750, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nice try but the shot doesn''t work for me.  If the fence was the texture the animal is too distracting and if the animal is your texture then the fence is too distracting.  No clear definition of what your subject is because of the theme.</td>', 'Nice try but the shot doesn''t work for me.  If the fence was the texture the animal is too distracting and if the animal is your texture then the fence is too distracting.  No clear definition of what your subject is because of the theme.', '2009-04-14 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436073, 780554, 80104, '<td valign="top">I have no idea either.  What is this?  Unfortunately is very soft and would need to be much sharper.</td>', 'I have no idea either.  What is this?  Unfortunately is very soft and would need to be much sharper.', '2009-04-14 08:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436074, 780540, 80104, '<td valign="top">I bumped my score up by one after reviewing this shot.  It''s not a great shot but at least it''s sharp.  It seems much too harsh on the left side.</td>', 'I bumped my score up by one after reviewing this shot.  It''s not a great shot but at least it''s sharp.  It seems much too harsh on the left side.', '2009-04-14 08:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436075, 780010, 80104, '<td valign="top">The picture just seems to soft to me(even though the droplet areas are sharp).</td>', 'The picture just seems to soft to me(even though the droplet areas are sharp).', '2009-04-14 08:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436076, 780454, 80104, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen too much of this stuff in my youth at our cottage.  Actually it''s sharp but it seems very uninteresting as a subject.</td>', 'I''ve seen too much of this stuff in my youth at our cottage.  Actually it''s sharp but it seems very uninteresting as a subject.', '2009-04-14 08:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436077, 779285, 80104, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus wasn''t as soft.</td>', 'Wish the focus wasn''t as soft.', '2009-04-14 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436078, 780163, 80104, '<td valign="top">The shot is missing oomff</td>', 'The shot is missing oomff', '2009-04-14 08:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436080, 780354, 80104, '<td valign="top">Wish there was a sharper forcus on this photo.  Maybe on the shrooms.</td>', 'Wish there was a sharper forcus on this photo.  Maybe on the shrooms.', '2009-04-14 08:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436081, 780352, 80104, '<td valign="top">The good:<br/>Focus<br/>Sharp<br/> <br/>The Bad:<br/>Uninteresting subject imo</td>', 'The good:FocusSharp The Bad:Uninteresting subject imo', '2009-04-14 08:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436082, 779602, 80104, '<td valign="top">Wish the chick''s head was in focus instead of the belly area.</td>', 'Wish the chick''s head was in focus instead of the belly area.', '2009-04-14 08:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436084, 778977, 80104, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m staring into a cave or into someone''s lungs.  Wish the colors weren''t so strange.</td>', 'I feel like I''m staring into a cave or into someone''s lungs.  Wish the colors weren''t so strange.', '2009-04-14 08:09:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5436085, 779570, 80104, '<td valign="top">Wish there was more focus to this shot.  It indeed is very grainy</td>', 'Wish there was more focus to this shot.  It indeed is very grainy', '2009-04-14 08:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436086, 780482, 80104, '<td valign="top">Nothing astounding about this shot.  Very narrow DOF which I think does this shot a disservice.  Wished a bit more was in focus.</td>', 'Nothing astounding about this shot.  Very narrow DOF which I think does this shot a disservice.  Wished a bit more was in focus.', '2009-04-14 08:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436087, 779642, 80104, '<td valign="top">This seems too abstract for my taste.</td>', 'This seems too abstract for my taste.', '2009-04-14 08:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436088, 780319, 80104, '<td valign="top">focus is fairly sharp but the color is very blah.  It''s not your fault, it''s just that the onion is not a very colorful object.  However, I am bumping your score up 2 notches from my first impression.</td>', 'focus is fairly sharp but the color is very blah.  It''s not your fault, it''s just that the onion is not a very colorful object.  However, I am bumping your score up 2 notches from my first impression.', '2009-04-14 08:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436089, 779051, 80104, '<td valign="top">It just about seems like there''s no real focus in this shot.  It doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'It just about seems like there''s no real focus in this shot.  It doesn''t do anything for me.', '2009-04-14 08:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436090, 780485, 80104, '<td valign="top">Just too soft for my taste.</td>', 'Just too soft for my taste.', '2009-04-14 08:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436091, 780007, 80104, '<td valign="top">I had some of his kind for Easter.  Wish the image was a tad sharper.</td>', 'I had some of his kind for Easter.  Wish the image was a tad sharper.', '2009-04-14 08:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436130, 780282, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is adorable. you''ve captured good texture and a very fun shot of your pet. unfortunately, it seems like there were problems when you resized or compressed the picture for dpc. that made things seem a little fuzzy around the edges and pixelated, so it sort of looks like a blown up cell phone pic. i use photoshop to resize and save for web, which gives a lot of control (you can change the quality until it''s just barely under the file size needed). a free alternative that i''ve used before is google''s picasa. it has some photo editing capability, and allows you to resize and select a custom amount of compression. you can read more <a href="//picasa.google.com/support/bin/answer.py?answer=13821&amp;topic=14199" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a></td>', 'this is adorable. you''ve captured good texture and a very fun shot of your pet. unfortunately, it seems like there were problems when you resized or compressed the picture for dpc. that made things seem a little fuzzy around the edges and pixelated, so it sort of looks like a blown up cell phone pic. i use photoshop to resize and save for web, which gives a lot of control (you can change the quality until it''s just barely under the file size needed). a free alternative that i''ve used before is google''s picasa. it has some photo editing capability, and allows you to resize and select a custom amount of compression. you can read more here', '2009-04-14 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436156, 779643, 103601, '<td valign="top">the shadow is very nice. i''d like maybe a little bit more space above the feather, it seems cropped just a bit too tight</td>', 'the shadow is very nice. i''d like maybe a little bit more space above the feather, it seems cropped just a bit too tight', '2009-04-14 09:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436163, 779211, 103601, '<td valign="top">you''ve done a fine job capturing the texture.</td>', 'you''ve done a fine job capturing the texture.', '2009-04-14 09:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436168, 779373, 103601, '<td valign="top">this looks 3D to me, it''s really really cool. nice job with the texture too</td>', 'this looks 3D to me, it''s really really cool. nice job with the texture too', '2009-04-14 09:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436173, 779127, 103601, '<td valign="top">very captivating and everything seems just about right from a technical standpoint.</td>', 'very captivating and everything seems just about right from a technical standpoint.', '2009-04-14 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436175, 780503, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and how you set up the shot. your post processing looks very good too. i''m not sure the shallow dof adds anything to highlight the texture, i''d like it a bit more of the closer crumbles were also in focus</td>', 'i like the lighting and how you set up the shot. your post processing looks very good too. i''m not sure the shallow dof adds anything to highlight the texture, i''d like it a bit more of the closer crumbles were also in focus', '2009-04-14 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436189, 779503, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is a great portrait and there is plenty of detail to pick out texture in his chin and pipe, pretty much anywhere.</td>', 'this is a great portrait and there is plenty of detail to pick out texture in his chin and pipe, pretty much anywhere.', '2009-04-14 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436195, 779950, 103601, '<td valign="top">the shallow dof works well in thsi shot to highlight the texture. nicely done</td>', 'the shallow dof works well in thsi shot to highlight the texture. nicely done', '2009-04-14 10:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436196, 780472, 103601, '<td valign="top">i think the lighting might be a bit too harsh and it takes away from the detail a bit.</td>', 'i think the lighting might be a bit too harsh and it takes away from the detail a bit.', '2009-04-14 10:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436198, 778921, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like everything about this, even the yellow frame (and i hardly ever like frames that aren''t either black or white). excellent attention to detail</td>', 'i like everything about this, even the yellow frame (and i hardly ever like frames that aren''t either black or white). excellent attention to detail', '2009-04-14 10:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436200, 780238, 103601, '<td valign="top">a very nice texture indeed. the shell at the top is really nice. might consider cropping out the bottom left a bit</td>', 'a very nice texture indeed. the shell at the top is really nice. might consider cropping out the bottom left a bit', '2009-04-14 10:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436202, 780289, 103601, '<td valign="top">the colors are awesome and i like how you chose to crop the shot. the lighting is also very good.</td>', 'the colors are awesome and i like how you chose to crop the shot. the lighting is also very good.', '2009-04-14 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436204, 778751, 103601, '<td valign="top">it''s very pretty and fun to look at. i''m not sure light has a texture, but the prism or whatever this object is definitely does.</td>', 'it''s very pretty and fun to look at. i''m not sure light has a texture, but the prism or whatever this object is definitely does.', '2009-04-14 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436208, 779239, 103601, '<td valign="top">this pops off my monitor, very nicely done. maybe it''s the contrast? it''s great, whatever it is.</td>', 'this pops off my monitor, very nicely done. maybe it''s the contrast? it''s great, whatever it is.', '2009-04-14 10:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436210, 780165, 103601, '<td valign="top">i really like how it fades from black to white from the top right corner to the bottom left.</td>', 'i really like how it fades from black to white from the top right corner to the bottom left.', '2009-04-14 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436212, 779490, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice work with the lighting, you did a nice job highlighting the texture. very interesting image.</td>', 'nice work with the lighting, you did a nice job highlighting the texture. very interesting image.', '2009-04-14 10:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436219, 780224, 103601, '<td valign="top">what an adorable pair! i really like how you got in the dirt to take the shot, it''s nice to see the bunny''s mouth. i think i might like a wider angle a bit more, so i could get a sense of their environment. i don''t think it would detract from the texture.</td>', 'what an adorable pair! i really like how you got in the dirt to take the shot, it''s nice to see the bunny''s mouth. i think i might like a wider angle a bit more, so i could get a sense of their environment. i don''t think it would detract from the texture.', '2009-04-14 10:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436221, 779375, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like how the top right is predominately orange and the bottom left is mostly white-ish. nicely processed</td>', 'i like how the top right is predominately orange and the bottom left is mostly white-ish. nicely processed', '2009-04-14 10:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436224, 780535, 103601, '<td valign="top">i really like the colors a lot. i can''t seem to find anything that is in sharp focus but it doesn''t really detract from the shot. maybe that is what you were going for. this is a very creative take on the challenge</td>', 'i really like the colors a lot. i can''t seem to find anything that is in sharp focus but it doesn''t really detract from the shot. maybe that is what you were going for. this is a very creative take on the challenge', '2009-04-14 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436228, 780477, 103601, '<td valign="top">beautiful portrait with great details in the feathers. his/her beak is a little soft, maybe a slightly less shallow dof would have helped a bit there. of course, with a bird i guess you need to keep the shutter speed as fast as possible, but this looks well lit. i''m rambling. nice job!</td>', 'beautiful portrait with great details in the feathers. his/her beak is a little soft, maybe a slightly less shallow dof would have helped a bit there. of course, with a bird i guess you need to keep the shutter speed as fast as possible, but this looks well lit. i''m rambling. nice job!', '2009-04-14 10:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436229, 779984, 103601, '<td valign="top">a nice collection of textures. it looks a bit dark to me, but the sharpness and detail are great</td>', 'a nice collection of textures. it looks a bit dark to me, but the sharpness and detail are great', '2009-04-14 10:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436236, 779642, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice depiction of texture. i like the contrast and the specs of green</td>', 'nice depiction of texture. i like the contrast and the specs of green', '2009-04-14 10:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436237, 780193, 103601, '<td valign="top">i love the nice warm feeling i get from this shot. the lighting is great</td>', 'i love the nice warm feeling i get from this shot. the lighting is great', '2009-04-14 10:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436239, 779952, 103601, '<td valign="top">good job bringing out the detail and texture in this guy.</td>', 'good job bringing out the detail and texture in this guy.', '2009-04-14 10:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436242, 780065, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like the colors in this shot and it does a nice job depicting texture. artistically, it''s not really captivating, but technically it''s well done</td>', 'i like the colors in this shot and it does a nice job depicting texture. artistically, it''s not really captivating, but technically it''s well done', '2009-04-14 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436243, 779900, 103601, '<td valign="top">the contrast helps bring out the texture very nicely. b&amp;w looks great too.</td>', 'the contrast helps bring out the texture very nicely. b&w looks great too.', '2009-04-14 10:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436245, 780541, 103601, '<td valign="top">very cool subject, nice detail in the rocky area on the left</td>', 'very cool subject, nice detail in the rocky area on the left', '2009-04-14 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436247, 780192, 103601, '<td valign="top">i like the way you lit this shot but i can''t see as much detail in the peel as i''d like to really get a feeling for the texture. the reflection is really cool</td>', 'i like the way you lit this shot but i can''t see as much detail in the peel as i''d like to really get a feeling for the texture. the reflection is really cool', '2009-04-14 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436248, 779477, 103601, '<td valign="top">the color is really cool, and i like how you cropped this shot.</td>', 'the color is really cool, and i like how you cropped this shot.', '2009-04-14 10:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436252, 780311, 103601, '<td valign="top">this is a really interesting picture. nice job with the processing, it looks great.</td>', 'this is a really interesting picture. nice job with the processing, it looks great.', '2009-04-14 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436257, 780356, 103601, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but the magenta outline on the left side of the strawberry is sort of distracting. the colors are great though</td>', 'nice shot, but the magenta outline on the left side of the strawberry is sort of distracting. the colors are great though', '2009-04-14 10:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
