(5436415, 780065, 66398, '<td valign="top">Air under a pool cover? This works good for texture but I think maybe it would have benefitted from a larger dof. The wrinkles in the plastic would have helped if they were in focus.</td>', 'Air under a pool cover? This works good for texture but I think maybe it would have benefitted from a larger dof. The wrinkles in the plastic would have helped if they were in focus.', '2009-04-14 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436425, 779661, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure how large or small this is but if it is large the shot may be improved by adding a person somewhere in the lower right area. If it is smaller that wouldn''t work though. The more I look the more I''m thinking it''s smaller because of the water drops. Good composition but the dark whole in the bottom left is slightly bothersome.</td>', 'Not sure how large or small this is but if it is large the shot may be improved by adding a person somewhere in the lower right area. If it is smaller that wouldn''t work though. The more I look the more I''m thinking it''s smaller because of the water drops. Good composition but the dark whole in the bottom left is slightly bothersome.', '2009-04-14 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436426, 779655, 66398, '<td valign="top">I saw a recipe the other day for Matzah with some chocolate on it. It looked so good. This works good for texture and I like the diagonal composition.</td>', 'I saw a recipe the other day for Matzah with some chocolate on it. It looked so good. This works good for texture and I like the diagonal composition.', '2009-04-14 12:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436431, 780017, 66398, '<td valign="top">It''s texture. Good comp. Maybe a little overexposed but not bad. dof works well. Overall not bad. Only thing is there are some other shots I like better. This doesn''t hold me as an intriguing image.</td>', 'It''s texture. Good comp. Maybe a little overexposed but not bad. dof works well. Overall not bad. Only thing is there are some other shots I like better. This doesn''t hold me as an intriguing image.', '2009-04-14 12:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436442, 780328, 66398, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t bad and it fits the challenge but it doesn''t hold me as an intriguing image. Maybe if you move in and got the bark on this tree? However there are other shots like that so maybe not. From your title I''m assuming you intend the rings to be the subject however it is the human tendency to look first at the brightest or most in focus portion of an image and the bark is where my eye keeps going.</td>', 'This shot isn''t bad and it fits the challenge but it doesn''t hold me as an intriguing image. Maybe if you move in and got the bark on this tree? However there are other shots like that so maybe not. From your title I''m assuming you intend the rings to be the subject however it is the human tendency to look first at the brightest or most in focus portion of an image and the bark is where my eye keeps going.', '2009-04-14 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436451, 780538, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe for a texture shot if you moved in and composed more on the urchins or whatever they are in the hands As for technical it looks a little flat so maybe a little increase in contrast or curves. Kind of a cool shot though</td>', 'Maybe for a texture shot if you moved in and composed more on the urchins or whatever they are in the hands As for technical it looks a little flat so maybe a little increase in contrast or curves. Kind of a cool shot though', '2009-04-14 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436454, 779884, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and texture here but the overblown corners are distracting.</td>', 'I like the colors and texture here but the overblown corners are distracting.', '2009-04-14 12:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436464, 780208, 66398, '<td valign="top">This would work well with an increased dof since the challenge is about texture. I do like the colors and there is some interesting texture going on but seeing more of it would work better in my opinion.</td>', 'This would work well with an increased dof since the challenge is about texture. I do like the colors and there is some interesting texture going on but seeing more of it would work better in my opinion.', '2009-04-14 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436470, 780141, 66398, '<td valign="top">Cool capture. The diagonals add interest and the different textures on the water are neat. Possibly just a little more room on the top somehow to see more of that texture.</td>', 'Cool capture. The diagonals add interest and the different textures on the water are neat. Possibly just a little more room on the top somehow to see more of that texture.', '2009-04-14 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436473, 780105, 66398, '<td valign="top">Yes it is and a cute one at that. Since it''s about the nose, the shallow dof works good to take attention away from those very awesome eyes.</td>', 'Yes it is and a cute one at that. Since it''s about the nose, the shallow dof works good to take attention away from those very awesome eyes.', '2009-04-14 12:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436481, 780473, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best of the shots with tree rings. Good composition, lighting, and processing. I like the choice to make it b/w.</td>', 'This is probably the best of the shots with tree rings. Good composition, lighting, and processing. I like the choice to make it b/w.', '2009-04-14 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436498, 780036, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. The leaf is just a tiny bit overexposed but to change that there would be trade of and I think the trade off wold make the dark areas too dark or make the image a little too flat overall. So it works well the way it is. I like the b/w choice. Perhaps if the leaf was red and there were no other reds in the shot then adjustment of the luminance in the reds would bring the leaf down slightly on brightness? The dof is right on here. Good job.</td>', 'Well done. The leaf is just a tiny bit overexposed but to change that there would be trade of and I think the trade off wold make the dark areas too dark or make the image a little too flat overall. So it works well the way it is. I like the b/w choice. Perhaps if the leaf was red and there were no other reds in the shot then adjustment of the luminance in the reds would bring the leaf down slightly on brightness? The dof is right on here. Good job.', '2009-04-14 12:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436509, 779647, 66398, '<td valign="top">This might have been a little monotonous without the blue lettering so I like having that in the shot. Possibly a little tighter crop on the right side just to the edge of the freezer (or whatever it is) would improve it a little.</td>', 'This might have been a little monotonous without the blue lettering so I like having that in the shot. Possibly a little tighter crop on the right side just to the edge of the freezer (or whatever it is) would improve it a little.', '2009-04-14 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436515, 780316, 66398, '<td valign="top">The flower in the lower right corner was a good choice. It gives the eye somewhere to rest. Overall the image is a little flat so maybe a little more contrast would help.</td>', 'The flower in the lower right corner was a good choice. It gives the eye somewhere to rest. Overall the image is a little flat so maybe a little more contrast would help.', '2009-04-14 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436519, 780554, 66398, '<td valign="top">It almost looks obscene. lol. I think this would benefit from a greater dof though.</td>', 'It almost looks obscene. lol. I think this would benefit from a greater dof though.', '2009-04-14 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436526, 780142, 66398, '<td valign="top">The center composition of the cone isn''t helping this image and the upper left corner is overexposed. The texture of the dead grass is good so maybe making that the subject by moving in a little closer there but having the cone still in the shot but not centered would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'The center composition of the cone isn''t helping this image and the upper left corner is overexposed. The texture of the dead grass is good so maybe making that the subject by moving in a little closer there but having the cone still in the shot but not centered would have made this a stronger image.', '2009-04-14 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436530, 779402, 87305, '<td valign="top">Impresive !! Good One... 10</td>', 'Impresive !! Good One... 10', '2009-04-14 12:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436532, 780280, 66398, '<td valign="top">Overall this is a nice photo. I''m not fond of the dark corner on the bottom left though so maybe just a little crop off that side or brightening it up a little somehow without compromising the nice look you have going on in the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Overall this is a nice photo. I''m not fond of the dark corner on the bottom left though so maybe just a little crop off that side or brightening it up a little somehow without compromising the nice look you have going on in the rest of the shot.', '2009-04-14 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436536, 779337, 87305, '<td valign="top">Good Light</td>', 'Good Light', '2009-04-14 12:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436539, 779604, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like that it''s a different choice of subject than anyone else in the challenge but some things for thought would be that piece in the top left is distracting so maybe removing that and putting in another piece that is darker or change the angle and quality of your lighting. Also it seems just a little flat so some curves could help.</td>', 'I like that it''s a different choice of subject than anyone else in the challenge but some things for thought would be that piece in the top left is distracting so maybe removing that and putting in another piece that is darker or change the angle and quality of your lighting. Also it seems just a little flat so some curves could help.', '2009-04-14 12:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436541, 780470, 66398, '<td valign="top">Refreshing. It looks like a mouth with its tongue sticking out.</td>', 'Refreshing. It looks like a mouth with its tongue sticking out.', '2009-04-14 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
