(5436558, 780349, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to comment on this one. It isn''t a bad shot technically and it certainly meets the challenge but it isn''t very interesting to me. Some of the shots I like in the challenge have somewhere interesting to rest my eye while the major portion of the shot is about texture. I suppose that would be a way to add interest here. Maybe take that rock that''s off to the right and put it more into the shot? Or a flower?</td>', 'Not sure how to comment on this one. It isn''t a bad shot technically and it certainly meets the challenge but it isn''t very interesting to me. Some of the shots I like in the challenge have somewhere interesting to rest my eye while the major portion of the shot is about texture. I suppose that would be a way to add interest here. Maybe take that rock that''s off to the right and put it more into the shot? Or a flower?', '2009-04-14 12:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436563, 779848, 66398, '<td valign="top">This might look better in b/w. I don''t mean that it doesn''t look good in color just that b/w "might" look better.</td>', 'This might look better in b/w. I don''t mean that it doesn''t look good in color just that b/w "might" look better.', '2009-04-14 12:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
