(5436574, 779950, 66398, '<td valign="top">Done very well. Good composition and dof. Nice lighting and color. Possibly just a tiny bit increase in dof but not too much in order to bring focus to a little more of the delicate underside of this mushroom.</td>', 'Done very well. Good composition and dof. Nice lighting and color. Possibly just a tiny bit increase in dof but not too much in order to bring focus to a little more of the delicate underside of this mushroom.', '2009-04-14 12:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
