(5436580, 780338, 66398, '<td valign="top">Yeah my body says time is brutal too. lol. Well done. The dof works well because most of it is in focus but the bright part on the top right isn''t which is a good thing since it is way up over there. That keeps me looking inside the photo instead of drawing me out.</td>', 'Yeah my body says time is brutal too. lol. Well done. The dof works well because most of it is in focus but the bright part on the top right isn''t which is a good thing since it is way up over there. That keeps me looking inside the photo instead of drawing me out.', '2009-04-14 12:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436583, 779268, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Wish it was more closeup however but still sharp and nice.</td>', 'Very well done.  Wish it was more closeup however but still sharp and nice.', '2009-04-14 13:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436584, 780311, 66398, '<td valign="top">For some reason this looks obscene. lol. Very well lit and exposed!! I can''t think of a single thing to say to improve this shot. Technically or even subject choice. There just happens to be some great wow shots out there imo.</td>', 'For some reason this looks obscene. lol. Very well lit and exposed!! I can''t think of a single thing to say to improve this shot. Technically or even subject choice. There just happens to be some great wow shots out there imo.', '2009-04-14 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
