(5436608, 780480, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool image. Great texture, technical is done very well. Only thing I can think of is that if there was something to show scale. Especially if it is a large area where putting a person in the shot would only take a small portion.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool image. Great texture, technical is done very well. Only thing I can think of is that if there was something to show scale. Especially if it is a large area where putting a person in the shot would only take a small portion.', '2009-04-14 13:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
