(5436642, 780469, 66398, '<td valign="top">Greater dof would work better here because the bottom left needs to be in focus imo. Love the composition and contrast of the leaf. It would be a much different (and boring) photo without it. Having great texture is the point of the challenge but there are a few shots that are nothing but the texture with no place to focus on. Good job.</td>', 'Greater dof would work better here because the bottom left needs to be in focus imo. Love the composition and contrast of the leaf. It would be a much different (and boring) photo without it. Having great texture is the point of the challenge but there are a few shots that are nothing but the texture with no place to focus on. Good job.', '2009-04-14 13:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436645, 780454, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and great texture but for me it''s a little boring. Possibly adding a nail or a hammer or something to the image would make it better.</td>', 'Good exposure and great texture but for me it''s a little boring. Possibly adding a nail or a hammer or something to the image would make it better.', '2009-04-14 13:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436651, 780238, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is great. Only point I can see for improving it is maybe put that little shell over into the bottom left. I like the crop on the left and bottom. Love the color and texture.</td>', 'This is great. Only point I can see for improving it is maybe put that little shell over into the bottom left. I like the crop on the left and bottom. Love the color and texture.', '2009-04-14 13:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436656, 780509, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great composition, dof, color, lighting, contrast and exposure. Interesting texture. Even the title is cool.</td>', 'Great composition, dof, color, lighting, contrast and exposure. Interesting texture. Even the title is cool.', '2009-04-14 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436662, 779809, 66398, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. He looks kind of bored. Very well done. lol just noticed the title.</td>', 'This made me smile. He looks kind of bored. Very well done. lol just noticed the title.', '2009-04-14 13:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436668, 780498, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great job with the lighting. Interesting texture without being boring. After seeing and commenting on so many photos its great to have a subject that has texture instead of texture being the only subject.</td>', 'Great job with the lighting. Interesting texture without being boring. After seeing and commenting on so many photos its great to have a subject that has texture instead of texture being the only subject.', '2009-04-14 13:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436674, 779952, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love elephants. You''ve captured this one and the texture of his skin quite well. I think maybe a little too harsh on the sharpening though.</td>', 'I love elephants. You''ve captured this one and the texture of his skin quite well. I think maybe a little too harsh on the sharpening though.', '2009-04-14 13:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436682, 779490, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great shot. There is a time for everything and this book has seen so much of it already and there is still so much to be seen. Perfect technicals and great texture.</td>', 'Great shot. There is a time for everything and this book has seen so much of it already and there is still so much to be seen. Perfect technicals and great texture.', '2009-04-14 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
