(5436692, 780546, 66398, '<td valign="top">The bright reflection is a tiny bit distracting but overall this is well done. I''m not much of a fan of borders but this one works. Maybe just a little closer to the edge on it would be better though.</td>', 'The bright reflection is a tiny bit distracting but overall this is well done. I''m not much of a fan of borders but this one works. Maybe just a little closer to the edge on it would be better though.', '2009-04-14 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436699, 779622, 66398, '<td valign="top">This could be sharper. Maybe you couldn''t because of what is there but I think moving the camera up just a little would help. The dark shadow adds nothing to the shot and there seems to be great texture in the fence that could be included toward the top. That would also give it more of a thirds composition which would be helpful in this case.</td>', 'This could be sharper. Maybe you couldn''t because of what is there but I think moving the camera up just a little would help. The dark shadow adds nothing to the shot and there seems to be great texture in the fence that could be included toward the top. That would also give it more of a thirds composition which would be helpful in this case.', '2009-04-14 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436705, 780009, 66398, '<td valign="top">This might have been improved with b/w and some curves to add contrast. As is it''s a little flat and though the elephant may have a red tint it is most likely that the white balance was off.</td>', 'This might have been improved with b/w and some curves to add contrast. As is it''s a little flat and though the elephant may have a red tint it is most likely that the white balance was off.', '2009-04-14 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436713, 780540, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is probably the best of the tree bark textures in the challenge. However maybe a little bug or sparkling sap or something in the shot would add some interest.</td>', 'This is probably the best of the tree bark textures in the challenge. However maybe a little bug or sparkling sap or something in the shot would add some interest.', '2009-04-14 13:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436720, 778831, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good combination of textures. I like the angle.</td>', 'Good combination of textures. I like the angle.', '2009-04-14 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
