(5436746, 778746, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love how you''ve taken two different objects and completed the circle. I think I would place the fan at an angle equal to the strings on the guitar though. Well done.</td>', 'I love how you''ve taken two different objects and completed the circle. I think I would place the fan at an angle equal to the strings on the guitar though. Well done.', '2009-04-14 13:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
