(5436785, 780337, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. Maybe some added interest if you strategically placed a yellow banana just off to the edge. Many of the texture shots shots in this challenge that I find intriguing have great texture but also give me something to focus on besides the texture. It sort of breaks up the monotony that way. This one however is one of the best of those that have only texture and nothing else.</td>', 'Well done. Maybe some added interest if you strategically placed a yellow banana just off to the edge. Many of the texture shots shots in this challenge that I find intriguing have great texture but also give me something to focus on besides the texture. It sort of breaks up the monotony that way. This one however is one of the best of those that have only texture and nothing else.', '2009-04-14 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436808, 780143, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great job. dof isn''t too shallow. Theres something there besides "just" texture the texture that is there is really good. lighting is good, not too flat. A tiny bit hot on the nose though but not too bad.</td>', 'Great job. dof isn''t too shallow. Theres something there besides "just" texture the texture that is there is really good. lighting is good, not too flat. A tiny bit hot on the nose though but not too bad.', '2009-04-14 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436813, 780329, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Could be better with either greater dof or having the focus point in the foreground with the child slightly oof. Also might be improved with a little more of the steps and stonework. I realize that might not have been possible depending on what was going on outside the frame of what you have though.</td>', 'Great idea. Could be better with either greater dof or having the focus point in the foreground with the child slightly oof. Also might be improved with a little more of the steps and stonework. I realize that might not have been possible depending on what was going on outside the frame of what you have though.', '2009-04-14 14:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436817, 778751, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. The angle is good and the spots on the prism give it good texture.</td>', 'Love the colors. The angle is good and the spots on the prism give it good texture.', '2009-04-14 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436818, 780418, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is great. The focus and texture of the um... thing is great and I love the colorful oof bg.</td>', 'This is great. The focus and texture of the um... thing is great and I love the colorful oof bg.', '2009-04-14 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436824, 778949, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great placement of the flower with the interesting pattern of the stems. Only thing I can think of to improve this is maybe a different bg choice. I like how that little bud interacts with the shape of the flowers petal.</td>', 'Great placement of the flower with the interesting pattern of the stems. Only thing I can think of to improve this is maybe a different bg choice. I like how that little bud interacts with the shape of the flowers petal.', '2009-04-14 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436826, 780211, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the added interest of the diagonals.</td>', 'I like the added interest of the diagonals.', '2009-04-14 14:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436829, 779992, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little noisy but well done overall.</td>', 'A little noisy but well done overall.', '2009-04-14 14:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436831, 780308, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the composition here but it''s a good exposure.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the composition here but it''s a good exposure.', '2009-04-14 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436833, 779595, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. It does look like the moon and shows great texture. I like the bg color choice too.</td>', 'Well done. It does look like the moon and shows great texture. I like the bg color choice too.', '2009-04-14 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436834, 779100, 66398, '<td valign="top">The dof works well here as well as the choice of focus point.</td>', 'The dof works well here as well as the choice of focus point.', '2009-04-14 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436836, 780027, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think a different bg color would work better. I love the lighting though.</td>', 'I think a different bg color would work better. I love the lighting though.', '2009-04-14 14:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436837, 780348, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. composition is great. Interesting to look at. Good colors. Maybe I''d move that green thing about mid photo camera right though.</td>', 'Well done. composition is great. Interesting to look at. Good colors. Maybe I''d move that green thing about mid photo camera right though.', '2009-04-14 14:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436838, 780462, 66398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great composition. Perfect exposure. Love the angles. Aperture choice works well. And great texture.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great composition. Perfect exposure. Love the angles. Aperture choice works well. And great texture.', '2009-04-14 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436839, 779101, 66398, '<td valign="top">Some added contrast might help this a little. Nice job though overall.</td>', 'Some added contrast might help this a little. Nice job though overall.', '2009-04-14 14:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436841, 779199, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of it considering the title but maybe a little too much on the yellow side. Moving a little to the cooler side on the temperature would still keep enough warmth but not be too overdone.</td>', 'I like the warmth of it considering the title but maybe a little too much on the yellow side. Moving a little to the cooler side on the temperature would still keep enough warmth but not be too overdone.', '2009-04-14 14:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436844, 779503, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Nice textures. Something interesting to look at.</td>', 'Great colors. Nice textures. Something interesting to look at.', '2009-04-14 14:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436845, 779528, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well lit to bring out the aging of the hands. I like the stop clock in the shot too.</td>', 'Well lit to bring out the aging of the hands. I like the stop clock in the shot too.', '2009-04-14 14:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436847, 779784, 66398, '<td valign="top">The color temperature (white balance) isn''t attractive to me in this one. It''s also a little flat so adding some contrast might help it too.</td>', 'The color temperature (white balance) isn''t attractive to me in this one. It''s also a little flat so adding some contrast might help it too.', '2009-04-14 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436848, 779467, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice job. This is one that works really well with shallow dof. Some of them don''t but this one does.</td>', 'Nice job. This is one that works really well with shallow dof. Some of them don''t but this one does.', '2009-04-14 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436852, 780360, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Maybe just a touch more contrast in curves.</td>', 'Very well done. Maybe just a touch more contrast in curves.', '2009-04-14 14:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436853, 779404, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good composition, good texture, good dof, good contrast and exposure.</td>', 'Good composition, good texture, good dof, good contrast and exposure.', '2009-04-14 14:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436857, 780358, 66398, '<td valign="top">great capture and good textures. dof works well too.</td>', 'great capture and good textures. dof works well too.', '2009-04-14 14:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436858, 780547, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like it. Texture is the subject but it isn''t monotonous because you have added interest with the large water drop on the top right and I like the colors here.</td>', 'I like it. Texture is the subject but it isn''t monotonous because you have added interest with the large water drop on the top right and I like the colors here.', '2009-04-14 14:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436862, 779637, 66398, '<td valign="top">After 230 comments so far, I''m finding that the shots I score higher have great texture like yours does but also something else in the shot to break up the monotony of the texture. This is well done overall with great lighting, good dof choice for the subject, good contrast.... technically it''s good and it fits the challenge. It just needs something to break up the monotony of the shot.</td>', 'After 230 comments so far, I''m finding that the shots I score higher have great texture like yours does but also something else in the shot to break up the monotony of the texture. This is well done overall with great lighting, good dof choice for the subject, good contrast.... technically it''s good and it fits the challenge. It just needs something to break up the monotony of the shot.', '2009-04-14 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436864, 779729, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice different textures</td>', 'Nice different textures', '2009-04-14 14:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436865, 780157, 66398, '<td valign="top">mmmmm. Great shot. Not noisy, good comp, good contrast, well exposed. Hmm... I like to try to give something though for improvement. I do like the composition here but maybe it would be better to have recomposed and put it more to the bottom right. I''d have to see it that way to know for sure. Just a thought.</td>', 'mmmmm. Great shot. Not noisy, good comp, good contrast, well exposed. Hmm... I like to try to give something though for improvement. I do like the composition here but maybe it would be better to have recomposed and put it more to the bottom right. I''d have to see it that way to know for sure. Just a thought.', '2009-04-14 14:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436866, 779536, 36141, '<td valign="top">Well, you got me hungry, haven''t eaten yet. Plain and simple, love it.</td>', 'Well, you got me hungry, haven''t eaten yet. Plain and simple, love it.', '2009-04-14 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436869, 779365, 66398, '<td valign="top">Hello there fellow Orygonian. Love the purple colors. Maybe an improvement could be more of a thirds composition instead of centering the mussels.</td>', 'Hello there fellow Orygonian. Love the purple colors. Maybe an improvement could be more of a thirds composition instead of centering the mussels.', '2009-04-14 14:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436872, 779522, 36141, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture, but I would have cropped out only the middle part.</td>', 'Very nice texture, but I would have cropped out only the middle part.', '2009-04-14 14:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436875, 779579, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is another shot that has great technicals and great texture. But as I''ve noted on some of the other ones, I think having something else in the shot would help it. Having just texture (which I realize is the challenge topic) makes for a monotonous photograph. Adding something minimally into the shot gives the eye something to rest on and take a breath before exploring or going back to the texture. I like the border here though.</td>', 'This is another shot that has great technicals and great texture. But as I''ve noted on some of the other ones, I think having something else in the shot would help it. Having just texture (which I realize is the challenge topic) makes for a monotonous photograph. Adding something minimally into the shot gives the eye something to rest on and take a breath before exploring or going back to the texture. I like the border here though.', '2009-04-14 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436877, 780495, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the choice to divide the photo evenly.</td>', 'Well done. I like the choice to divide the photo evenly.', '2009-04-14 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436881, 779658, 66398, '<td valign="top">A bit more off the bottom would get rid of that oof dark part but still not compromise the shot. Overall well done. Maybe a bit too saturated for my taste but I see it as the artists choice and not really overdone. Looks like maybe a little too sharpened though.</td>', 'A bit more off the bottom would get rid of that oof dark part but still not compromise the shot. Overall well done. Maybe a bit too saturated for my taste but I see it as the artists choice and not really overdone. Looks like maybe a little too sharpened though.', '2009-04-14 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436884, 780524, 66398, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide if I like the dof here or not. On one hand it helps bring the eye into that great texture but on the other hand that bottom right corner isn''t attractive. Maybe just a little crop off the bottom or recomposing toward the top left but keeping the same dof? Not sure. Technicals look great and it isn''t monotonous with a single texture/pattern over the entire photo.</td>', 'Can''t decide if I like the dof here or not. On one hand it helps bring the eye into that great texture but on the other hand that bottom right corner isn''t attractive. Maybe just a little crop off the bottom or recomposing toward the top left but keeping the same dof? Not sure. Technicals look great and it isn''t monotonous with a single texture/pattern over the entire photo.', '2009-04-14 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436919, 780363, 66398, '<td valign="top">This looks like maybe an out-take from the fauna challenge. I like them both. Painted with light right? Done very well!! While I love the photo and agree that there is texture I think there are others that work better for the challenge. Of course that''s just my preference. I''m making it a fave but because I love the photo itself.</td>', 'This looks like maybe an out-take from the fauna challenge. I like them both. Painted with light right? Done very well!! While I love the photo and agree that there is texture I think there are others that work better for the challenge. Of course that''s just my preference. I''m making it a fave but because I love the photo itself.', '2009-04-14 15:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436924, 779617, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but I think a greater dof or at least changing the point of focus to have the foreground more in focus would work better.</td>', 'I like the composition but I think a greater dof or at least changing the point of focus to have the foreground more in focus would work better.', '2009-04-14 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436927, 779051, 66398, '<td valign="top">It looks soft. The overexposed corner is distracting.</td>', 'It looks soft. The overexposed corner is distracting.', '2009-04-14 15:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436932, 780224, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like you caught that white one in the middle of a sniff or maybe he''s chewing... his nose is crooked. Kind of cute!! An appropriate image for easter huh? Good textures and overall good shot.</td>', 'Looks like you caught that white one in the middle of a sniff or maybe he''s chewing... his nose is crooked. Kind of cute!! An appropriate image for easter huh? Good textures and overall good shot.', '2009-04-14 16:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436935, 779663, 66398, '<td valign="top">This would have been much better imo with a corrected white balance. Other than that it''s a very nice shot.</td>', 'This would have been much better imo with a corrected white balance. Other than that it''s a very nice shot.', '2009-04-14 16:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436939, 779339, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very cool image but a greater dof would make it better in my opinion.</td>', 'Very cool image but a greater dof would make it better in my opinion.', '2009-04-14 16:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436947, 780463, 66398, '<td valign="top">Way too much sharpening. It brings things more into focus but creates noise where there shouldn''t be and makes those little white spots which are not attractive. Using a diffused light source with a greater dof and sharp focus would have gotten a better result than trying to fix it by sharpening. One way to help a photo that isn''t as sharp as you''d like is to use contrast and curves.</td>', 'Way too much sharpening. It brings things more into focus but creates noise where there shouldn''t be and makes those little white spots which are not attractive. Using a diffused light source with a greater dof and sharp focus would have gotten a better result than trying to fix it by sharpening. One way to help a photo that isn''t as sharp as you''d like is to use contrast and curves.', '2009-04-14 16:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436949, 779055, 66398, '<td valign="top">The reflection of an umbrella on the outdoor glass picnic table? Good choice for the challenge. Maybe a little more exposure and/or contrast would make it better.</td>', 'The reflection of an umbrella on the outdoor glass picnic table? Good choice for the challenge. Maybe a little more exposure and/or contrast would make it better.', '2009-04-14 16:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436953, 779836, 66398, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice catch!! If I weren''t going through all the images in the challenge and commenting I might have missed this.  Not a fan of the border here but wow what a catch. The flying sand makes for great texture as well as the rusted pole and horseshoe in the background. Excellent.</td>', 'Wow, nice catch!! If I weren''t going through all the images in the challenge and commenting I might have missed this.  Not a fan of the border here but wow what a catch. The flying sand makes for great texture as well as the rusted pole and horseshoe in the background. Excellent.', '2009-04-14 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436962, 780496, 66398, '<td valign="top">Life is persistent given time isn''t it? This isn''t bad but I think the bright bud on the left is quite interesting so maybe shooting it so that you have that one as the main focus and add a little more dof to have some of the dark burned ashes in focus too. the best part of this one is the left half. The right half doesn''t seem to add anything to it imo. However it doesn''t take away from anything as is either. Just a thought.</td>', 'Life is persistent given time isn''t it? This isn''t bad but I think the bright bud on the left is quite interesting so maybe shooting it so that you have that one as the main focus and add a little more dof to have some of the dark burned ashes in focus too. the best part of this one is the left half. The right half doesn''t seem to add anything to it imo. However it doesn''t take away from anything as is either. Just a thought.', '2009-04-14 16:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436964, 779392, 66398, '<td valign="top">The lighting could be better here. Maybe a composition in that shadowed area with more exposure?</td>', 'The lighting could be better here. Maybe a composition in that shadowed area with more exposure?', '2009-04-14 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436969, 780284, 66398, '<td valign="top">Kind of noisy in the shadows. And a little bright on the skin making it difficult to see the skin texture on his cheek. However I do love the textures you''ve captured of his facial hair.</td>', 'Kind of noisy in the shadows. And a little bright on the skin making it difficult to see the skin texture on his cheek. However I do love the textures you''ve captured of his facial hair.', '2009-04-14 16:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436973, 780346, 66398, '<td valign="top">Very interesting to look at. You have a multitude of texture here which is well captured.</td>', 'Very interesting to look at. You have a multitude of texture here which is well captured.', '2009-04-14 16:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436975, 778950, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Great texture.</td>', 'Love the colors. Great texture.', '2009-04-14 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436976, 780553, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love it!!</td>', 'Love it!!', '2009-04-14 16:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436977, 779990, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. Great warmth but not overdone. perfect texture with something added to focus the eye on. Good job.</td>', 'Well done. Great warmth but not overdone. perfect texture with something added to focus the eye on. Good job.', '2009-04-14 16:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436978, 779536, 66398, '<td valign="top">The size is a little small but not too bad. I think it might be a little better if you moved in a little to the left side.</td>', 'The size is a little small but not too bad. I think it might be a little better if you moved in a little to the left side.', '2009-04-14 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436982, 780206, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. At first look I thought it was another over-sharpened image but there isn''t any noise in the shadows so this is a natural look of the texture created by light and shadow. Your whites don''t look white enough so maybe a little curves would help? Not too much so that you blow out the flower or plug up the darks but just a little to brighten up the flower just a tad.</td>', 'Well done. At first look I thought it was another over-sharpened image but there isn''t any noise in the shadows so this is a natural look of the texture created by light and shadow. Your whites don''t look white enough so maybe a little curves would help? Not too much so that you blow out the flower or plug up the darks but just a little to brighten up the flower just a tad.', '2009-04-14 16:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436984, 779127, 66398, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done. Lighting, exposure, processing all done very well. Combination of textures and something interesting to look at that isn''t "JUST" texture.</td>', 'Beautifully done. Lighting, exposure, processing all done very well. Combination of textures and something interesting to look at that isn''t "JUST" texture.', '2009-04-14 16:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436989, 780007, 66398, '<td valign="top">Oh he looks so sad. This definitely has texture however the technical execution could be better. I think the dof works well and the composition is good but overall the photo is very flat. This could be helped with lighting during the capture or in post you can bring it out more with some curves and contrast.</td>', 'Oh he looks so sad. This definitely has texture however the technical execution could be better. I think the dof works well and the composition is good but overall the photo is very flat. This could be helped with lighting during the capture or in post you can bring it out more with some curves and contrast.', '2009-04-14 16:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436991, 779777, 66398, '<td valign="top">It does look like puzzle pieces. Great colors and overall well done. It''s a little on the small size not utilizing as much screen real-estate as you could have.</td>', 'It does look like puzzle pieces. Great colors and overall well done. It''s a little on the small size not utilizing as much screen real-estate as you could have.', '2009-04-14 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436995, 779116, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo overall but I don''t find it fitting texture very well. I realize there is texture in the foreground of the image but it doesn''t appear to me as the subject of the shot.</td>', 'This is a great photo overall but I don''t find it fitting texture very well. I realize there is texture in the foreground of the image but it doesn''t appear to me as the subject of the shot.', '2009-04-14 16:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436997, 780387, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice job... good texture as the primary focus, something interesting to look at, good technicals.</td>', 'Nice job... good texture as the primary focus, something interesting to look at, good technicals.', '2009-04-14 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436999, 780404, 66398, '<td valign="top">White balance seems off to me. Not sure about the choice of focus point combined with the shallow dof but the more I look the more interested I become.</td>', 'White balance seems off to me. Not sure about the choice of focus point combined with the shallow dof but the more I look the more interested I become.', '2009-04-14 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437000, 780375, 66398, '<td valign="top">If it weren''t in the texture challenge I wouldn''t see this as a texture photo. It is a nice portrait though!!</td>', 'If it weren''t in the texture challenge I wouldn''t see this as a texture photo. It is a nice portrait though!!', '2009-04-14 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437006, 780164, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the blueish and orange shells or whatever they are in the foreground help or hinder. They are what they are though right? I love the way the waves lead me up to the rock.</td>', 'Not sure if the blueish and orange shells or whatever they are in the foreground help or hinder. They are what they are though right? I love the way the waves lead me up to the rock.', '2009-04-14 16:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437007, 780545, 66398, '<td valign="top">And a little 5 o clock shadow too huh?</td>', 'And a little 5 o clock shadow too huh?', '2009-04-14 16:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437009, 780402, 36141, '<td valign="top">Pity it''s all so out of focus. I think it would have been better if you had taken this photo straight down to the ground or if the foreground would have been real sharp.</td>', 'Pity it''s all so out of focus. I think it would have been better if you had taken this photo straight down to the ground or if the foreground would have been real sharp.', '2009-04-14 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437010, 779456, 66398, '<td valign="top">It looks more red to me. A little curves could help here. As is it''s a little flat.</td>', 'It looks more red to me. A little curves could help here. As is it''s a little flat.', '2009-04-14 16:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437014, 780535, 36141, '<td valign="top">A bit too much neat image for my taste, but still a good texture.</td>', 'A bit too much neat image for my taste, but still a good texture.', '2009-04-14 17:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437015, 779084, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is some trick with a ball or fruit or something but whether it is or not doesn''t really matter. This is an awesome image. Great job.</td>', 'Not sure if this is some trick with a ball or fruit or something but whether it is or not doesn''t really matter. This is an awesome image. Great job.', '2009-04-14 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437016, 779360, 36141, '<td valign="top">Good texture, but I would have loved to see it in a more natural color, it''s just too green for me.</td>', 'Good texture, but I would have loved to see it in a more natural color, it''s just too green for me.', '2009-04-14 17:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437017, 779377, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little flat but great job capturing the texture. A little increased exposure and some curves would make it better.</td>', 'A little flat but great job capturing the texture. A little increased exposure and some curves would make it better.', '2009-04-14 17:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437019, 780463, 36141, '<td valign="top">Seems like a bit overexposed. There''s hardly any texture in the white and orange anymore.</td>', 'Seems like a bit overexposed. There''s hardly any texture in the white and orange anymore.', '2009-04-14 17:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437020, 779589, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice textures</td>', 'Nice textures', '2009-04-14 17:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437021, 779677, 66398, '<td valign="top">I see a combination of texture but the wood is more in the realm of pattern to me. Neither here nor there I suppose as the two seem interchangeable to me. Well done.</td>', 'I see a combination of texture but the wood is more in the realm of pattern to me. Neither here nor there I suppose as the two seem interchangeable to me. Well done.', '2009-04-14 17:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437022, 779091, 36141, '<td valign="top">Finally some original thinking. Very nice.</td>', 'Finally some original thinking. Very nice.', '2009-04-14 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437025, 779339, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice, the contrast of soft and sharp texture.</td>', 'Nice, the contrast of soft and sharp texture.', '2009-04-14 17:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437027, 779285, 66398, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t fit the term abstract imo but that doesn''t matter I suppose. Looks like you used a high iso or over-sharpened (based on the noise in the shadows). More likely a high iso as the image doesn''t appear sharp to me. It does fit the challenge with texture though. Maybe an off center composition would improve it a bit.</td>', 'This doesn''t fit the term abstract imo but that doesn''t matter I suppose. Looks like you used a high iso or over-sharpened (based on the noise in the shadows). More likely a high iso as the image doesn''t appear sharp to me. It does fit the challenge with texture though. Maybe an off center composition would improve it a bit.', '2009-04-14 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437028, 780527, 36141, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures in the wood and stone wall, the person is distracting for me. Without him, it would have been a very strong texture photo (hope he won''t be offended).</td>', 'Lovely textures in the wood and stone wall, the person is distracting for me. Without him, it would have been a very strong texture photo (hope he won''t be offended).', '2009-04-14 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437029, 778831, 36141, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2009-04-14 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437030, 780186, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Good studio shot. Lighting is done well and the image is sharp and well contrasted. Baskets make a good texture too.</td>', 'Nicely done! Good studio shot. Lighting is done well and the image is sharp and well contrasted. Baskets make a good texture too.', '2009-04-14 17:12:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5437031, 780166, 66398, '<td valign="top">I really like this as an image. It''s pretty dark but it leaves just enough light in just the right places to set the mood. It''s a belly with a belly piercing right? Nice job. Not sure it says texture to me but still a nice photo.</td>', 'I really like this as an image. It''s pretty dark but it leaves just enough light in just the right places to set the mood. It''s a belly with a belly piercing right? Nice job. Not sure it says texture to me but still a nice photo.', '2009-04-14 17:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437032, 780355, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice, I got tired of all the hands, but this one is a relief.</td>', 'Nice, I got tired of all the hands, but this one is a relief.', '2009-04-14 17:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437035, 780083, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love how you have the one piling so close in the foreground and right on dof to still leave enough detail in the water and the background which all add to the texture but leave me focused on the piling in the front. Great job.</td>', 'I love how you have the one piling so close in the foreground and right on dof to still leave enough detail in the water and the background which all add to the texture but leave me focused on the piling in the front. Great job.', '2009-04-14 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437037, 779643, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the wood. The feather is a bit too much, the wood alone would have done very well for me.</td>', 'Nice texture on the wood. The feather is a bit too much, the wood alone would have done very well for me.', '2009-04-14 17:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437038, 779400, 66398, '<td valign="top">It is texture and the technicals aren''t bad but it''s kind of boring honestly. I don''t mean that in a bad way just that it doesn''t hold my interest which might be the reason you don''t have a higher score. Maybe if there was something to rest the eye on like a flower or the end of a burnt stick or.... well something.</td>', 'It is texture and the technicals aren''t bad but it''s kind of boring honestly. I don''t mean that in a bad way just that it doesn''t hold my interest which might be the reason you don''t have a higher score. Maybe if there was something to rest the eye on like a flower or the end of a burnt stick or.... well something.', '2009-04-14 17:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437039, 780353, 36141, '<td valign="top">They sure are textured. Nice take.</td>', 'They sure are textured. Nice take.', '2009-04-14 17:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437041, 779683, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little diffusion on the light would still give it good texture. The bright spots add interest but I think a diffused light would have worked better. Good job getting clarity and dof while being in so close.</td>', 'A little diffusion on the light would still give it good texture. The bright spots add interest but I think a diffused light would have worked better. Good job getting clarity and dof while being in so close.', '2009-04-14 17:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437042, 778966, 66398, '<td valign="top">I love the quality of light on this and the cool tones. Great shot!!</td>', 'I love the quality of light on this and the cool tones. Great shot!!', '2009-04-14 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437043, 779128, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great job. You''ve broken up the monotony with the opposing lines in the corners. A little on the warm side but maybe you intended it that way. Try making it just a tad cooler and see what you think though.</td>', 'Great job. You''ve broken up the monotony with the opposing lines in the corners. A little on the warm side but maybe you intended it that way. Try making it just a tad cooler and see what you think though.', '2009-04-14 17:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437045, 780450, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the composition.</td>', 'Nice, love the composition.', '2009-04-14 17:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437046, 779478, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice job. There''s another one with a cat''s nose but it includes the green eyes. Here I am more focused on the texture of the nose rather than the fact that it''s a cat. Well done.</td>', 'Nice job. There''s another one with a cat''s nose but it includes the green eyes. Here I am more focused on the texture of the nose rather than the fact that it''s a cat. Well done.', '2009-04-14 17:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437048, 780333, 66398, '<td valign="top">technically this could be improved with a bump up in exposure and some curves. Shallow dof is okay but just a little more depth would be better I think.</td>', 'technically this could be improved with a bump up in exposure and some curves. Shallow dof is okay but just a little more depth would be better I think.', '2009-04-14 17:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437049, 780274, 66398, '<td valign="top">lol that''s funny. I like the blue reflection. The combination of warm and cold tones work well.</td>', 'lol that''s funny. I like the blue reflection. The combination of warm and cold tones work well.', '2009-04-14 17:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437050, 780359, 66398, '<td valign="top">What a cutie. Good job overall. Maybe a little bump in curves? Or maybe not as that might interfere with the softness that works well here.</td>', 'What a cutie. Good job overall. Maybe a little bump in curves? Or maybe not as that might interfere with the softness that works well here.', '2009-04-14 17:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437051, 779459, 66398, '<td valign="top">It looks like it''s popping off the page. Could be a little sharper though.</td>', 'It looks like it''s popping off the page. Could be a little sharper though.', '2009-04-14 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437053, 779532, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice job. This is what I''ve been commenting about on some other images. Having the texture as the largest part of the image but breaking up the monotony with something interesting to look at. You''ve done that well.</td>', 'Nice job. This is what I''ve been commenting about on some other images. Having the texture as the largest part of the image but breaking up the monotony with something interesting to look at. You''ve done that well.', '2009-04-14 17:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437054, 778930, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Not many thought about using the clouds as a texture.</td>', 'Nice job. Not many thought about using the clouds as a texture.', '2009-04-14 17:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437055, 778711, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Something interesting to look at in the foreground with texture yet the rest of the photo also has texture. Way to go.</td>', 'Great composition. Something interesting to look at in the foreground with texture yet the rest of the photo also has texture. Way to go.', '2009-04-14 17:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437057, 780315, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s playing peek a boo. Well done. Great technicals, love the lighting, PP is done well and great texture.</td>', 'Looks like he''s playing peek a boo. Well done. Great technicals, love the lighting, PP is done well and great texture.', '2009-04-14 17:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437059, 780339, 66398, '<td valign="top">Great example of how to use a fisheye well to your advantage. Texture with an interesting photo.</td>', 'Great example of how to use a fisheye well to your advantage. Texture with an interesting photo.', '2009-04-14 17:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437060, 780402, 66398, '<td valign="top">The shallow dof here is not helping. With a greater dof we''d be able to see the texture better.</td>', 'The shallow dof here is not helping. With a greater dof we''d be able to see the texture better.', '2009-04-14 17:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437061, 779522, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. Maybe a tad over-sharpened but not bad.</td>', 'Well done. Maybe a tad over-sharpened but not bad.', '2009-04-14 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437064, 780279, 66398, '<td valign="top">It must have been a team concept to have all of you make a moon out of a cantaloupe. I think maybe this is a little underexposed though.</td>', 'It must have been a team concept to have all of you make a moon out of a cantaloupe. I think maybe this is a little underexposed though.', '2009-04-14 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437097, 779329, 86305, '<td valign="top">excellent, I have cloned your fingerprint and am just going to get a new passport<br/> <br/>;-)<br/> <br/>nice close-up</td>', 'excellent, I have cloned your fingerprint and am just going to get a new passport ;-) nice close-up', '2009-04-14 17:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437138, 779777, 102031, '<td valign="top">The color scheme isn''t terribly impressive, but it does fit the contest concept well.</td>', 'The color scheme isn''t terribly impressive, but it does fit the contest concept well.', '2009-04-14 18:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437198, 779907, 105700, '<td valign="top">i love the title!</td>', 'i love the title!', '2009-04-14 19:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437199, 780353, 66398, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail doesn''t do this one justice. I thought they were oranges. Technicals are very good! Love the complimentary color for the bg. Only thing I can think of is maybe having that middle one (just as it is) next to a ripe good one with a bite out of it. It would give a comparison texture and variety of texture including the smoothness of the ripe apple and the grainy texture of the inside as well as the wrinkled old look of the rotting one. Just a thought. I like this one like it is too though.</td>', 'The thumbnail doesn''t do this one justice. I thought they were oranges. Technicals are very good! Love the complimentary color for the bg. Only thing I can think of is maybe having that middle one (just as it is) next to a ripe good one with a bite out of it. It would give a comparison texture and variety of texture including the smoothness of the ripe apple and the grainy texture of the inside as well as the wrinkled old look of the rotting one. Just a thought. I like this one like it is too though.', '2009-04-14 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437201, 779503, 105171, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  A lesser color processing could have made this even better.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  A lesser color processing could have made this even better.', '2009-04-14 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437204, 780410, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think the light falls off a little too much toward the bottom of the image. It isn''t so much that it loses detail but maybe adding a diffused fill light from the bottom would bring out more of the tables texture too. the exposure on the leaf is very good and overall this is interesting to look at. Well done.</td>', 'I think the light falls off a little too much toward the bottom of the image. It isn''t so much that it loses detail but maybe adding a diffused fill light from the bottom would bring out more of the tables texture too. the exposure on the leaf is very good and overall this is interesting to look at. Well done.', '2009-04-14 19:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437209, 779849, 66398, '<td valign="top">Funny enough I don''t think you have enough contrast in this image. There is an even gray tone with no bright brights and dark darks imo. The two textues are contrasting though if that''s what you meant by the title. A little curves would make it a better photo though.</td>', 'Funny enough I don''t think you have enough contrast in this image. There is an even gray tone with no bright brights and dark darks imo. The two textues are contrasting though if that''s what you meant by the title. A little curves would make it a better photo though.', '2009-04-14 19:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437214, 779900, 66398, '<td valign="top">Never heard of that. They are interesting little creatures though aren''t they? Good exposure and contrast. dof choice works well.</td>', 'Never heard of that. They are interesting little creatures though aren''t they? Good exposure and contrast. dof choice works well.', '2009-04-14 19:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437221, 779847, 105171, '<td valign="top">Great show of texture and color!</td>', 'Great show of texture and color!', '2009-04-14 19:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437225, 779589, 66398, '<td valign="top">I do like the brightness in this image but I''m not fond of the shadows. Maybe a fill light from the top right would help minimize that. Also the tool on the left might have been better placed by turning it around so that the brush is in the foreground. You have the similar textures on the other 3 tools and the shape of that one is similar to the red one so turning it around would add not only interest but bring in another texture which is lost off the screen on the left. It also looks like that one has more rust on the other end of it too. Overall well done.</td>', 'I do like the brightness in this image but I''m not fond of the shadows. Maybe a fill light from the top right would help minimize that. Also the tool on the left might have been better placed by turning it around so that the brush is in the foreground. You have the similar textures on the other 3 tools and the shape of that one is similar to the red one so turning it around would add not only interest but bring in another texture which is lost off the screen on the left. It also looks like that one has more rust on the other end of it too. Overall well done.', '2009-04-14 19:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437240, 778921, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. It held my interest for a good bit. As I look for something to comment on the only thing I can find is maybe the droplet at the left near the center is a little distracting but in basic there''s not much you can do about that. Cropping it out would make you lose too much of that wonderful green texture. Maybe during the shoot adjust the light or "style the fruit" by dabbing that spot would help. Great shot.</td>', 'This is very well done. It held my interest for a good bit. As I look for something to comment on the only thing I can find is maybe the droplet at the left near the center is a little distracting but in basic there''s not much you can do about that. Cropping it out would make you lose too much of that wonderful green texture. Maybe during the shoot adjust the light or "style the fruit" by dabbing that spot would help. Great shot.', '2009-04-14 19:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437242, 779953, 66398, '<td valign="top">Looks like some kind of ancient octopus with horns. This would probably benefit from some added contrast in curves though.</td>', 'Looks like some kind of ancient octopus with horns. This would probably benefit from some added contrast in curves though.', '2009-04-14 19:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437247, 779337, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I like where the word wilson is. Just enough to know what it is but not a dominant feature of the shot. The lighting sets off the texture on the threading quite well. Maybe a tad increased dof would help. Just enough to bring focus to the foreground texture but not enough to bring the background in focus.</td>', 'Good composition. I like where the word wilson is. Just enough to know what it is but not a dominant feature of the shot. The lighting sets off the texture on the threading quite well. Maybe a tad increased dof would help. Just enough to bring focus to the foreground texture but not enough to bring the background in focus.', '2009-04-14 19:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437248, 779354, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the warm glow of light on this but I kind of wish there was a little more of it.</td>', 'I like the warm glow of light on this but I kind of wish there was a little more of it.', '2009-04-14 19:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437253, 778775, 66398, '<td valign="top">Shallow dof works well to keep me on the nose which is your intent so well done there. The crop on the bottom cuts out a lot of texture though with that purple blanket so maybe a little less cut from the bottom would be better. It would also alleviate a bit of the tension caused by the muzzle at the bottom of the shot. Kind of give it room to breathe.... lol</td>', 'Shallow dof works well to keep me on the nose which is your intent so well done there. The crop on the bottom cuts out a lot of texture though with that purple blanket so maybe a little less cut from the bottom would be better. It would also alleviate a bit of the tension caused by the muzzle at the bottom of the shot. Kind of give it room to breathe.... lol', '2009-04-14 19:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437258, 779394, 66398, '<td valign="top">If the focus is supposed to be the moss then maybe it would be a better shot to focus on the foreground moss and then recompose to where you have it now. I like the overall dof I just think the foreground moss would have made a better focus point. As is I have to look into the photo more to see the texture of the moss and back there I don''t see it as well. The angle of the railing is good so I would still follow through to the rest of the photo which still has other interest and texture to see.</td>', 'If the focus is supposed to be the moss then maybe it would be a better shot to focus on the foreground moss and then recompose to where you have it now. I like the overall dof I just think the foreground moss would have made a better focus point. As is I have to look into the photo more to see the texture of the moss and back there I don''t see it as well. The angle of the railing is good so I would still follow through to the rest of the photo which still has other interest and texture to see.', '2009-04-14 19:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437262, 780213, 66398, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit hot on the lower left. This cold be improved by moving the light source further away. Not too much though or you''d lose the good quality of light on the rest of the shot. Good texture and overall well done.</td>', 'It''s a bit hot on the lower left. This cold be improved by moving the light source further away. Not too much though or you''d lose the good quality of light on the rest of the shot. Good texture and overall well done.', '2009-04-14 19:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437264, 780356, 66398, '<td valign="top">and hairy. Diffusing the light source would show off the berry a little better imo. For the most part the lighting looks good. It''s just that one spot there that could be diffused a little. Maybe an added fill light on the right could show off the hairy stem a little better too. The colors look pretty good though.</td>', 'and hairy. Diffusing the light source would show off the berry a little better imo. For the most part the lighting looks good. It''s just that one spot there that could be diffused a little. Maybe an added fill light on the right could show off the hairy stem a little better too. The colors look pretty good though.', '2009-04-14 19:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437269, 779643, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done. I love the shadow on this. The texture of the wood contrasted by the feathers own unique texture and the darkness of the shadow all work well together. Good job.</td>', 'Well done. I love the shadow on this. The texture of the wood contrasted by the feathers own unique texture and the darkness of the shadow all work well together. Good job.', '2009-04-14 19:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437273, 780021, 66398, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good composition, Great lighting and exposure, contrast is right on. dof works well. And it not only meets the challenge but it''s interesting to look at. Good job.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good composition, Great lighting and exposure, contrast is right on. dof works well. And it not only meets the challenge but it''s interesting to look at. Good job.', '2009-04-14 19:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437276, 780449, 66398, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a very interesting shot to me. The only portion is focus is the top left corner. It is flat middle grey tones and not much shown for texture. Although I know you tried. Maybe try reshooting with some added light, better focus more toward the front of the shot and perhaps a lower angle.</td>', 'This isn''t a very interesting shot to me. The only portion is focus is the top left corner. It is flat middle grey tones and not much shown for texture. Although I know you tried. Maybe try reshooting with some added light, better focus more toward the front of the shot and perhaps a lower angle.', '2009-04-14 19:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437278, 780048, 66398, '<td valign="top">Moving just slightly back a little but keeping nearly the same angle might show off the nice texture of this trees bark a little better. Moving too far back though would lose the nice view of the limbs against that nice clouded light blue sky so not too much. Just a little. Overall well done.</td>', 'Moving just slightly back a little but keeping nearly the same angle might show off the nice texture of this trees bark a little better. Moving too far back though would lose the nice view of the limbs against that nice clouded light blue sky so not too much. Just a little. Overall well done.', '2009-04-14 19:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437315, 780289, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the better shots in the challenge of the strawberries. The color seems more true to the fruit. The green leafs are much better represented here. However the same thing I said with the others applies here too. Diffusion of the light would help to make it a better shot imo. leaving your light where it is just putting a thin piece of waxed paper between the light and the strawberry would get rid of those bright reflective spots. I think it would be a better shot that way. Well done overall.</td>', 'I think this is one of the better shots in the challenge of the strawberries. The color seems more true to the fruit. The green leafs are much better represented here. However the same thing I said with the others applies here too. Diffusion of the light would help to make it a better shot imo. leaving your light where it is just putting a thin piece of waxed paper between the light and the strawberry would get rid of those bright reflective spots. I think it would be a better shot that way. Well done overall.', '2009-04-14 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437321, 780079, 66398, '<td valign="top">At first glance it looks like ripples from a drop of liquid but after closer inspection it looks like an actual piece of silk positioned to look like that. Well done in that regard. Composition looks good but maybe a little more exposure and more dof would improve the overall shot.</td>', 'At first glance it looks like ripples from a drop of liquid but after closer inspection it looks like an actual piece of silk positioned to look like that. Well done in that regard. Composition looks good but maybe a little more exposure and more dof would improve the overall shot.', '2009-04-14 20:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437323, 780233, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you included the larger shell in a thirds position. It gives the eye a place to rest and take a break while looking at all the interesting texture you have going on. contrast looks pretty good. Maybe a tad more? But maybe not. I''m not much of a fan of borders but it might help in this case to keep me in the photo. Nothing elaborate just a little one. Good large dof and focus.</td>', 'I''m glad you included the larger shell in a thirds position. It gives the eye a place to rest and take a break while looking at all the interesting texture you have going on. contrast looks pretty good. Maybe a tad more? But maybe not. I''m not much of a fan of borders but it might help in this case to keep me in the photo. Nothing elaborate just a little one. Good large dof and focus.', '2009-04-14 20:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437327, 779955, 66398, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting but I wish it didn''t have that shadow on the bottom right. I''m kind of torn as to wether I want to see more of the leaf on the top left or not. dof, contrast, color are all good.</td>', 'Love the lighting but I wish it didn''t have that shadow on the bottom right. I''m kind of torn as to wether I want to see more of the leaf on the top left or not. dof, contrast, color are all good.', '2009-04-14 20:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437329, 780107, 102031, '<td valign="top">A whole different look at it... I like it.</td>', 'A whole different look at it... I like it.', '2009-04-14 20:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437330, 780075, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not sure you needed to explain it in the title but okay. You''ve got an original here. Well in this challenge at least. The texture of the snow is very intriguing indeed. The snow is a little gray and could use a little bump in exposure. There aren''t any other spots in the shot that would suffer from it so it wouldn''t hurt. Or alternately (or even in addition) you could change the color temp to just a bit warmer.</td>', 'Not sure you needed to explain it in the title but okay. You''ve got an original here. Well in this challenge at least. The texture of the snow is very intriguing indeed. The snow is a little gray and could use a little bump in exposure. There aren''t any other spots in the shot that would suffer from it so it wouldn''t hurt. Or alternately (or even in addition) you could change the color temp to just a bit warmer.', '2009-04-14 20:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437339, 780362, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well done shot. I''m sure this bride is happy with it. Great combination of textures. A little overexposed in the whites but not distractingly so.</td>', 'Well done shot. I''m sure this bride is happy with it. Great combination of textures. A little overexposed in the whites but not distractingly so.', '2009-04-14 20:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437341, 779108, 66398, '<td valign="top">I think there''s too many entries in this challenge. I thought I already commented and voted on this one. There''s either another one similar or I just looked at it and thought I made the comment. Anyway. Nicely done. Maybe some more light or fill bounce on the left side would help to bring in the texture there too. I like the contrast of the smooth new wood revealed and the play of light and shadow there. A little more dof would bring focus to the bottom portion which is sort of blurry.</td>', 'I think there''s too many entries in this challenge. I thought I already commented and voted on this one. There''s either another one similar or I just looked at it and thought I made the comment. Anyway. Nicely done. Maybe some more light or fill bounce on the left side would help to bring in the texture there too. I like the contrast of the smooth new wood revealed and the play of light and shadow there. A little more dof would bring focus to the bottom portion which is sort of blurry.', '2009-04-14 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437343, 779744, 66398, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you didn''t put a title about the texture on the water. Nice job. The silky smooth sky with the rough water is a good combination. Well done.</td>', 'I''m glad you didn''t put a title about the texture on the water. Nice job. The silky smooth sky with the rough water is a good combination. Well done.', '2009-04-14 21:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437346, 780074, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like the included texture in the background. A little wider dof to get that other eye and whiskers in focus too would be good. They would add to the textures already present. Technically well done. Overall good job.</td>', 'I like the included texture in the background. A little wider dof to get that other eye and whiskers in focus too would be good. They would add to the textures already present. Technically well done. Overall good job.', '2009-04-14 21:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437348, 779954, 66398, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little overexposed. The even lighting isn''t bad but maybe some dramatic side lighting would show off the texture a little better. The colors are interesting with the alternating greens though.</td>', 'Maybe a little overexposed. The even lighting isn''t bad but maybe some dramatic side lighting would show off the texture a little better. The colors are interesting with the alternating greens though.', '2009-04-14 21:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437350, 780052, 102031, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot for this topic, both in textures and in the use of color.</td>', 'Excellent shot for this topic, both in textures and in the use of color.', '2009-04-14 21:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437353, 780502, 66398, '<td valign="top">It''s a little on the small side but well exposed, Lighting and composition look good. Patterns and textures are interesting. Not a wow shot but still well done.</td>', 'It''s a little on the small side but well exposed, Lighting and composition look good. Patterns and textures are interesting. Not a wow shot but still well done.', '2009-04-14 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437356, 780541, 66398, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures. The whites are a bit overexposed but I like the shallow dof and where you have the focus. A little work in curves could bring this out a little more though. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting textures. The whites are a bit overexposed but I like the shallow dof and where you have the focus. A little work in curves could bring this out a little more though. Well done.', '2009-04-14 21:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437363, 780010, 66398, '<td valign="top">While it has texture and interest I''m not fond of the color. Maybe it''s just me though. Not sure about the composition either. At first I don''t like the dark angle on the right but then it sort of compliments the opposite angle of the lines on the other side. Having the round things where they are works though. Is it buttons on a couch or piece of furniture?</td>', 'While it has texture and interest I''m not fond of the color. Maybe it''s just me though. Not sure about the composition either. At first I don''t like the dark angle on the right but then it sort of compliments the opposite angle of the lines on the other side. Having the round things where they are works though. Is it buttons on a couch or piece of furniture?', '2009-04-14 21:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437364, 780517, 66398, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors and texture in this. Just trying to figure out what it is. It kind of looks like glasses reflecting potpourri?</td>', 'I really like the colors and texture in this. Just trying to figure out what it is. It kind of looks like glasses reflecting potpourri?', '2009-04-14 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437366, 779906, 66398, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of dof and bg. A little fill light from camera right would bring in more detail in the darks of the "licorice". It''s an upside down mushroom right?</td>', 'I like your choice of dof and bg. A little fill light from camera right would bring in more detail in the darks of the "licorice". It''s an upside down mushroom right?', '2009-04-14 21:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437367, 780482, 66398, '<td valign="top">exposure, dof, contrast and colors all look good but there is no where to rest my eye really. Adding some item minimally to the shot would add interest and give the eye a place to rest and take a break from the chaos.</td>', 'exposure, dof, contrast and colors all look good but there is no where to rest my eye really. Adding some item minimally to the shot would add interest and give the eye a place to rest and take a break from the chaos.', '2009-04-14 21:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437373, 779642, 66398, '<td valign="top">A little increased exposure might work to bring in some more detail. contrast and colors look good though. The brown portions in the top left and bottom right keep me in the photo but maybe having something else... someplace to rest the eye and not just texture.</td>', 'A little increased exposure might work to bring in some more detail. contrast and colors look good though. The brown portions in the top left and bottom right keep me in the photo but maybe having something else... someplace to rest the eye and not just texture.', '2009-04-14 21:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437374, 779375, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good texture, good exposure, interest, composition all good. Only thing to change maybe is dof. increasing it would make a better image imo. Overall good job.</td>', 'Good texture, good exposure, interest, composition all good. Only thing to change maybe is dof. increasing it would make a better image imo. Overall good job.', '2009-04-14 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5437377, 779267, 66398, '<td valign="top">Good textures, composition and contrast. Color temperature in the bg from ambient light is giving red hue. It isn''t bad if you intended it but it wouldn''t be my choice. Looks like you used an on camera flash. Maybe a fill light from above at 5500 kelvin would help though.</td>', 'Good textures, composition and contrast. Color temperature in the bg from ambient light is giving red hue. It isn''t bad if you intended it but it wouldn''t be my choice. Looks like you used an on camera flash. Maybe a fill light from above at 5500 kelvin would help though.', '2009-04-14 21:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
