(5438076, 780485, 60173, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! I didn''t expect this to score this low. I know I was the first to comment and not give it a raving review, but 3.3 is pushing it. Had I voted, I would have been lenient on the "lack of focus", because to me it was obvious that focus wasn''t your intent, especially since you didn''t even have a lens on, heh. I''ve kept my eye on many of the side challenges, so I''ve better learned to spot this style. It''s clear there''s still lots of users that are as clueless as I was just a year ago.<br/> <br/>I still think the photo could have used some structural improvement, but I am disappointed to see you taking the brown. Keep doing what you do!<br/> <br/>=)</td>', 'Holy cow! I didn''t expect this to score this low. I know I was the first to comment and not give it a raving review, but 3.3 is pushing it. Had I voted, I would have been lenient on the "lack of focus", because to me it was obvious that focus wasn''t your intent, especially since you didn''t even have a lens on, heh. I''ve kept my eye on many of the side challenges, so I''ve better learned to spot this style. It''s clear there''s still lots of users that are as clueless as I was just a year ago. I still think the photo could have used some structural improvement, but I am disappointed to see you taking the brown. Keep doing what you do! =)', '2009-04-15 05:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
