(5438408, 780337, 58457, '<td valign="top">Congrats from your 135th place neighbor...  good rhythm and pattern in this shot.  Maybe it would be a bit more dramatic if the lighting were off to the side a bit.  I think the comment about the banana isn''t a bad one, perhaps another something in the photo to contrast the background.<br/> <br/>ETA: also... I agree with you... shoot for challenges.  Make a goal of a certain number per month---you''ll see your photography improve quite a bit.  I''m no pro, but I''ve gotten much better than when I started!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-04-15 09:13:12.</i></td>', 'Congrats from your 135th place neighbor...  good rhythm and pattern in this shot.  Maybe it would be a bit more dramatic if the lighting were off to the side a bit.  I think the comment about the banana isn''t a bad one, perhaps another something in the photo to contrast the background. ETA: also... I agree with you... shoot for challenges.  Make a goal of a certain number per month---you''ll see your photography improve quite a bit.  I''m no pro, but I''ve gotten much better than when I started!', '2009-04-15 10:11:54.000000', '2009-04-15 10:13:12.000000', 0),
