(5438547, 780096, 63218, '<td valign="top">I love the chances you took with this, I''m very impressed. I always see the color first (which is marvellous) &amp; the richness of detail in the various textures is fun to look at.  The light captures my attention. This little slice of life may be easy to walk by without noticing anything, but it is Art in this photograph.  That''s the photographer''s gift.  The Eye. Goog going here. I didn''t vote or enter this challenge but IMO the people who voted it &lt;5 didn''t take time to look at it. It''s an "instant fav" for me!</td>', 'I love the chances you took with this, I''m very impressed. I always see the color first (which is marvellous) & the richness of detail in the various textures is fun to look at.  The light captures my attention. This little slice of life may be easy to walk by without noticing anything, but it is Art in this photograph.  That''s the photographer''s gift.  The Eye. Goog going here. I didn''t vote or enter this challenge but IMO the people who voted it <5 didn''t take time to look at it. It''s an "instant fav" for me!', '2009-04-15 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 0),
