(5439243, 780016, 40687, '<td valign="top">This was the lining of a bracelet display box my wife was giving as a present.  I took the shot on macro setting to get the flash as close as possible to the material to show up the texture. I had to greyscale the image due to some tiny fibres of various colours spoiling the image<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments</td>', 'This was the lining of a bracelet display box my wife was giving as a present.  I took the shot on macro setting to get the flash as close as possible to the material to show up the texture. I had to greyscale the image due to some tiny fibres of various colours spoiling the image Thanks for the comments', '2009-04-15 17:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5439250, 779793, 90115, '<td valign="top">What a handsome fellow! Great portrait -- and kudos on your high place in the challenge! Technically -- and aesthetically, I guess -- it would have been nice to see some of that surprising iridescent mother-of-pearl color that iguanas usually show, but perhaps that requires daylight. Terrific detail and great composition of this "headshot", which your subject should feature in his modeling portfolio. Cheers!</td>', 'What a handsome fellow! Great portrait -- and kudos on your high place in the challenge! Technically -- and aesthetically, I guess -- it would have been nice to see some of that surprising iridescent mother-of-pearl color that iguanas usually show, but perhaps that requires daylight. Terrific detail and great composition of this "headshot", which your subject should feature in his modeling portfolio. Cheers!', '2009-04-15 17:23:08.000000', NULL, 0),
