(5443939, 780471, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really hate looking at this shot.  (I abhor snakes.)  But, I looked long enough to give it an 8.  :)</td>', 'I really hate looking at this shot.  (I abhor snakes.)  But, I looked long enough to give it an 8.  :)', '2009-04-19 16:38:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5446069, 780157, 4226, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>My first impression was textures? but yes it does fit the challenge.<br/> <br/>The composition throws me off a little, its too centered for me, I would have considered moving it further down and a close crop/shot, but again with 18-55 mm, you don''t have that much control as you mention. <br/> <br/>I like the reflection and overall the picture quality is good which usually ends up with better scores at dpc. <br/> <br/>I also noticed from your comment that you had trouble with the speed of the chocolate and then the motion blur and I see you were shooting at 1/200s, F5.6, ISO100.  Why not go higher on ISO? 400D I am sure can produce pretty clean results upto ISO400 which will give you fast enough shutter speeds and you could also trade-in some of the shutter speed for more dof if you like. <br/> <br/>regards,<br/>Gaurawa<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! My first impression was textures? but yes it does fit the challenge. The composition throws me off a little, its too centered for me, I would have considered moving it further down and a close crop/shot, but again with 18-55 mm, you don''t have that much control as you mention.  I like the reflection and overall the picture quality is good which usually ends up with better scores at dpc.  I also noticed from your comment that you had trouble with the speed of the chocolate and then the motion blur and I see you were shooting at 1/200s, F5.6, ISO100.  Why not go higher on ISO? 400D I am sure can produce pretty clean results upto ISO400 which will give you fast enough shutter speeds and you could also trade-in some of the shutter speed for more dof if you like.  regards,Gaurawa ', '2009-04-20 21:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
