(5455470, 780473, 61961, '<td valign="top">Some challenge entries confused "pattern" with "texture", but not this one.  I thought this was a strong entry.  The texture really stands out and makes me want to reach out and touch the wood.  The b&amp;w was a great choice and not to go overboard but it really does remind me of the great Ansel Adams.  So there! :-)</td>', 'Some challenge entries confused "pattern" with "texture", but not this one.  I thought this was a strong entry.  The texture really stands out and makes me want to reach out and touch the wood.  The b&w was a great choice and not to go overboard but it really does remind me of the great Ansel Adams.  So there! :-)', '2009-04-28 11:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5455475, 780420, 61961, '<td valign="top">I seemed to have overlooked this when voting; but now it catches my attention.  It''s a very appealing shot for reasons I can''t quite discern.  I love the "dust" in the upper-left corner and the duotone is lovely.  Those thorns look positively deadly!</td>', 'I seemed to have overlooked this when voting; but now it catches my attention.  It''s a very appealing shot for reasons I can''t quite discern.  I love the "dust" in the upper-left corner and the duotone is lovely.  Those thorns look positively deadly!', '2009-04-28 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
